\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Unconscious Interpretive Apparatus and Three Survival DynamicsL. Ron Hubbard gives an important clue when he says that the purpose of the life dynamics is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain TO SURVIVE. We will show that while it is the purpose of some life dynamics TO SURVIVE, it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is the purpose of other dynamics NOT TO SURVIVE in the present form. These dynamics\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain function mathematically and geometrically, and this functioning can be calculated and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain predicted.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b SURVIVAL IS THE PRIMITIVE PURPOSE OF THE WATER SIGNS OF THE ZODIAC.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There are three Water Signs which form an equilateral triangle in the mathematical figure we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have called the zodiac. These are the three emotional signs, CANCER, SCORPIO and PISCES,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and they-represent three different types of emotion which continually involve compulsions.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain To understand this lesson, we will ask you to consider the statement that LIFE IS\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lOO%~INTERPRETATION, and that most interpretation is unconscious. A great part of it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain misinterpretation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sight is the interpretation of light waves. A hazy object in the dusk may become a bear for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the small boy, and he will actually see a bear. His interpretive apparatus will fill in any missing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain details. Hearing is the interpretation of sound waves, and so on with the other of the five\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain orthodox senses. We refer to sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch because for a time it was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fashionable to deny all other senses. We do not know how many senses there are but there\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are more than five.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Everything coming in through the senses has to be interpreted. If you speak no language but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain English and you receive a telegram in Spanish, your problem of interpretation will become\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more complex.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Interpretation is largely an unconscious process, and therefore, we must introduce the\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b UNCONSCIOUS INTERPRETIVE APPARATUS.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When this apparatus functions in a healthy fashion, we have instinct, intuition and good\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain health, but it is a complex mechanism, involving many factors such as heredity and past\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain experience, and Its mis- interpretations may be followed by abnormal reactions such as pain,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain illness, compulsions and even insanity.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Emotion is a reaction to interpretation or misinterpretation on the part of the unconscious\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interpretive apparatus.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The conception that emotion is a reaction to unconscious Interpretation of incoming\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain extrasensory data is the result of a series of experiments over many years. The experiments\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain began as the result of a single incident that we will mention. It happened many years ago.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A strange feeling came over the writer as he was about to leave for another city on a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain business trip. He didn't want to go. Reason told him to go, but this strange feeling said not to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain go. There was conflict, and an experiment was decided upon. He would follow his feeling and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain check the result.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Within an hour the telephone rang. It was an attorney calling. He had traveled 250 miles to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain see the writer and would arrive in a few minutes. His visit proved financially profitable to both\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain parties. Upon his departure, the business for which the writer's journey had been planned\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was completed by long distance telephone.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Had reason been followed, the writer would have left before the attorney arrived.Continued\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain experimentation revealed that emotions often result from extrasensory information not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain obtainable through the five orthodox senses. This is not often observed because people are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not on the alert for it.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sigmund Freud was far from the first person attempting to interpret dreams. In ancient times,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they were used in an attempt to predict the future, and such illustrations are contained In the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Bible. Although there are rare cases where people dream true, and an interesting case will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain follow, we will find more evidence if we consider the average dream as a misinterpretation of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what is coming in over the extrasensory system. the writer's son tells of an upsetting dream,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in which a young lady neighbor takes sick and dies. The above theory is explained to him,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and it is agreed that results shall be observed carefully.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Within an hour, the young lady of the dream actually arrives and to use the telephone to call a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain veterinarian because her horse is sick. Twenty minutes later, she returns and announces the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain horse is dead. The horse had been ill at the time of the dream, which appeared a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain misinterpretation of the existing facts.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have a similarity in a television set which picks up video waves and interprets them. When\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the set is not tuned in correctly, we receive all kinds of designs closely resembling some bad\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain artist's conception of modernistic art.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Incidents buried deep in the memory can be restimulated in a dream. In such a dream, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain names of two men met thirty years before are mentioned and thus recalled. The dream is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain then related to a neighbor, because of the unusual factor of recall, for the men had been met\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain very casually at the time, and the meeting was of no significance. That the names should\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain suddenly turn Up in a dream after thirty years seemed phenomenal. The neighbor is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain impressed because he knows both men personally. They now reside in a town 2500 miles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain away from which the neighbor has just moved The neighbor and the writer have something in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain common. Would the dream have occurred otherwise?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Consider that the individual is subject to a constant bombardment of "messages" coming\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain through other than the five orthodox senses, as well as the orthodox senses, and the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconscious interpretive apparatus is constantly at work in an attempt to decode these with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain no help or cooperation from the conscious, because modern education has dogmatically\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain taught us that there are no such "messages." It works on its own, automatically and the result,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in most cases, is MISINTERPRETATION, which has many effects, including pain, dangerous\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compulsions, psychosomatic illness, aberrations, emotional upsets, mental crackups,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abnormal behavior, etc. In the few cases where the unconscious interpretive apparatus, ;with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sympathetic conscious help, interprets correctly, the individual is said to have good intuition.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Nervousness often appears to be the result of activity in the Unconscious interpretive\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain apparatus. The writer has satisfied himself, by careful observation and recording of data, that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when an important event affecting him is taking place at a distance, he experiences a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nervous reaction. He has also noted illness connected with such events.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A sudden, unexplainable feeling or emotion may be an event that has been picked up,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconsciously interpreted or misinterpreted, and there has been a reaction in the form of an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain emotion, a compulsion, nerv- ousness, and in some cases illness. If the interpretation is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain correct, the emotion might serve a good purpose, but if in error, it may be dangerous.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Much valuable data about the functioning of the unconscious interpretive apparatus can be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain obtained through a careful study of laboratory experiments with hypnosis. Under such\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain circumstances, interpretation can be directed by an operator. The interpretive apparatus will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain obey orders and accept commands. The hypnotized subject may be told that he will feel no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pain while a tooth is pulled. The tooth is pulled and no pain is experienced because pain is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reaction to interpretation. The subject may be told that when he awakens he will have a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain headache upon a certain signal, and the subject will experience the headache. There can still\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be conflict, and a directive may be obeyed only partially.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain An experiment at Harvard University will display some interesting data concerning\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compulsions. (See The Psychology of Suggestion, by Boris Sidis, once superintendent of the\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b N.Y. State Pathological Hospitals.)\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When an intelligent man is placed under hypnosis, the operator tells him that after he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain awakens, upon a certain signal, he is to rise, secure an umbrella from a corner of the room,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain raise it, and walk up and down the room six times.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain After awakening and when the subject is engaged in animated social conversation, the signal\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is given. He continues his conversation, but rises, secures the umbrella, and walks up and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain down the room six times.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b HE DOES NOT RAISE THE UMBRELLA.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When enlightened as to the planted suggestion, he explained, "I had a terrific desire to raise\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the umbrella, but it seemed so silly that I fought it down."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These principles have long been exploited by advertising experts who rely on bypassing the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious and getting their suggestions into the unconscious, where the interpretive\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain apparatus can be directed. They rely on repetition. A newspaper editor once remarked to the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain writer, people will believe anything if you tell it often enough and long enough. That is the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain principle behind all modern advertising. Reach the interpretive apparatus and you can cause\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a compulsion. Someone is forced to reach for a cigarette.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These are artificially created compulsions. They are conditioned reflexes. There are also\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain naturally created compulsions, and all compulsions have a dangerous potential. Compulsions\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are created by thou- sands of years of history, by your heredity, and by some very primitive\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things, but compulsions function mathematically, according to geometric patterns. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possible to understand these functions, and when we understand them, like the man with the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain umbrella, we don't have to do as a compulsion tells us. To thoroughly understand a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compulsion is a move to exclude its existence.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b A COMPULSION IS FREQUENTLY THE RESULT OF A SURVIVAL DYNAMIC BEING\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b BROUGHT INTO PLAY UNNECESSARILY AS THE RESULT OF A FAULTY INTERPRETATION\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b ON THE PART OF THE UNCONSCIOUS INTERPRETIVE APPARATUS. THEREFORE, IT\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b BECOMES IMPORTANT THAT WE KNOW AS MUCH AS POSSIBLE ABOUT THE\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b CHARACTER OF THE SURVIVAL DYNAMICS AND THE MANNER IN WHICH THEY\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b FUNCTION.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Let us pause to remind you that we earlier stated that it is our purpose to give you as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain complete an understanding of the twelve basic principles of astrology, as represented by the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain twelve signs of the zodiac. as possible, because the more thoroughly you understand these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain principles, the easier everything else will become. When you grasp these principles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain thoroughly, you'll almost go the rest of the way on your own. You will ultimately reach a point\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain where you will grasp things more rapidly than we can tell them to you. You will get ahead of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain us. Now, let us deal with the very first of these principles.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE INDIVIDUAL SURVIVAL DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The primitive purpose of CANCER is Individual Survival. This is the most primitive of all life\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purposes. Are you going to get enough to eat, or are you going to starve to death? Only one\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain thing counts. Are you going to get enough to eat? Unknown to themselves, in many people,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there is a record about this, and it plays over and over. It constantly repeats this question.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is no rest, for this record plays on, day and night. It never stops.. There is buried fear of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a food shortage, of possible starvation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In a civilization where there is an excess of food, this dynamic loses its utility, but it continues\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to function, and it constantly influences the interpretive apparatus, resulting in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain misinterpretations. It employs the same methods adopted by modern advertising agencies,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for they copied it.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Later, you will have the opportunity of studying those people whose lives are dominated by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this dynamic. Their behavior will have a new meaning for you. You will understand them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain better than they understand themselves.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain One person may become a thief or a sharp business man. His methods may ultimately\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain destroy him, but if they do riot, they may do ample damage to others. He may be very selfish,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and he may overeat, thus ruining his health. There may be balancing factors, so that he gets\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain along without too serious consequences. After all, he is friendly. lie is not violent. He is nice\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to you, and you will have to like him, because he seems harmless. You may feel sorry for him.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He is such an un-offensive person. He wants company, he is insecure: he doesn't like to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain alone. He might marry for money or to get a good cook. He has a close affinity for a dining\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain room or a kitchen. He is usually looked upon as domestic, because he unconsciously clings to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the home and the kitchen, where the food is kept. He likes people who invite him to dinner.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He saves things. In fact, his wife complains about the way he keeps the home and the back\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain yard cluttered up with junk. He is a conservative. (Calvin Coolidge and John D. Rockefeller\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain were of this sign.) He may hide money away in strange places. The women may be babyish\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain (so are the men), welcoming protection, and usually drawing it to themselves. Such people\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are always interested in shortages, and will buy up a short supply, in order to resell at a profit.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These people are great traders, and are constantly testing you to see how ripe you may be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for a trade that would be profitable to them. The men have a favorite expression, and no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain matter how much they accumulate it, they will keep repeating it. It goes, "I'm just a poor boy\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain trying to get along." This expression always seems to be a dead give-away. It will peg them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain every time. Thefactor of arrogant pride is completely lacking. They are humble and not above\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain begging. They make excellent salesmen, because they sense what the client needs, or they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain will study carefully until they learn, and will tolerate any kind of abuse in order to clinch a sale.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is never complete relaxation for something might go wrong, and there is ever a fear of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain poverty in old age. Such fears are ever being fed into the interpretive apparatus. Yet, these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people are kind. When John D. Rockefeller became the wealthiest man in America, he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain became noted for giving away newly coined dimes. They cost no more than old worn out\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dimes. The primitive still operates.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The writer's study of the birth dates of 5000 men listed in Who's Who in Commerce and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Industry (later published in Season of Birth, Ellswortn Huntington of Yale University) revealed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that Cancer men were the most successful in the accumulation of money.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The disease Cancer was originally named after this sign of the zodiac. The disease is an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accumulation of extra cells. There is no statistical data at the moment to show whether there\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is any connection. It should ultimately be investigated to determine whether the disease may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be the result of unconscious misinterpretation relating to fear of non-survival due to a food\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain shortage.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It should be noted that the ancients associated this sign with the stomach and the breasts.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Various zodiacs found in different parts of the world had different symbols for Cancer, but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there appears to be no place where the sign was not symbolized by a shell fish. The most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain common symbol was the crab to portray the characteristic of tenacity. The crab grips and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hangs on, and the Cancer native is likely to grip and hang onto money and possessions in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain same primitive manner. In dream symbology, kitchens or dining rooms appear to have some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain association with the individual survival dynamic. Such dreams may portray an unconscious\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fear of insecurity. We suggest, as an unproved fact, that the dynamic may have some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain association with the sense of smell. We know that the sense of smell is over-emphasized, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these people are very outspoken as to what odor is pleasant or unpleasant.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE FAMILY SURVIVAL DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The primitive purpose of SCORPIO is family survival. This is the next most primitive of all life\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purposes. The life of the family began before that of the individual and extends beyond the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain life of the individual. Are you going to continue the family? Will someone steal your mate? By\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain making sex a desired act, nature endeavors to perpetuate the family. The ancients associated\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Scorpio with the sex organs, but because of the quick temper that is also associated with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Scorpio, there may be an additional connection with the adrenal glands. At birth, this dynamic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is always conditioned. There is an almost infinite variety of possible patterns sex life can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain follow, and some of them can be very destructive. There are stimulants, curbs and shock\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain absorbers. The sex dynamic is powerful and not something that can be handled successfully\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain by invoking one set of rules for all persons, which is a dangerous procedure on the part of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain society. When insanity involves violence, it also involves the sex dynamic. All other violence\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain involves the sex dynamic directly or indirectly. Violence is an expression of fear.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Pains and fevers also have an association with this dynamic, but this will not include all types\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of pain. It will not include a toothache. We will discuss this elsewhere. As we have stated,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pain rises as a result of unconscious interpretation. It can be closely identified with sex. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sadist has to inflict pain to become sexually aroused, while the masochist has to endure pain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to become aroused.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is an odd circumstance worthy of investigation by the medical profession that the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrological and mathematical factors that create excessive sex desires under some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain circumstance will be accompanied by biological conditions necessitate surgery under other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain circumstances. This suggests the possibility that many physical aliments concern unhealthy\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning of the sexual system resulting from misinterpretations by the unconscious\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interpretive apparatus.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Conflicts involving this dynamic are perhaps the most vital studied in astrology. They involve\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pain violence, murder, rape and matters that occupy much space in sensational magazines\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain end newspapers, furnishing the background for best-selling fiction. Accidents are usually\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain caused by faulty functioning of this dynamic One's attention is usually placed elsewhere,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain often in another moment of time.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This dynamic can express itself in temper and violence, when the unconscious interpretive\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain apparatus interprets an incident as a threat to family survival, but the force can be poorly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain directed. It misses the mark.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The writer once had a Boston Terrier as friendly as they come, but she objected to anyone\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pulling her tall. If you pulled her tail, she would bite, but she would not bite you. You would be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain behind her, and would bite whoever was in front of her, without investigating.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If the boss gives Mr. Smith a bad day, Mr.Smith may go home and beat up his wife or children.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He does not beat up the boss. The force follows the course of least resistance. The attack is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain on the weak.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Children are often the object because they can't defend themselves. The release of emotion\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain follows the course of least resistance. If the boss himself' has this dynamic stimulated,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain everyone at the office may have a bad day. If the teacher has her family survival dynamic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain frustrated the night before, the children must be punished. The husband may leave his wife\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and hate a man who admires her, so he beats up his wife. Children are probably the chief\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain victims of the misdirection of this dynamic. In turn, they catch what the adult has, and cruelty\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may be their reaction. It becomes the way to act.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although vindictiveness is associated with Scorpio, there is an unconscious primitive cunning,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for this dynamic fails to function before superior power. It seldom directs its force against a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more powerful opponent, but will submit to and endure pain on such occasions, and this is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain where masochist tendencies appear to begin. In sadism, the desire to inflict pain is aimed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain toward the loved one instead of a possible competitor. Jealousy arouses the sex passion.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cruelty is an abnormal sex reaction.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have stated there are conditioning factors, and there are circumstances where general\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tendencies can be reversed. The old buffalo bull will fight to the death rather than allow a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain young bull to share his cows. The cows will become sexually stimulated and will also attack\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the old bull as soon as his defeat is apparent, and for future reference, note that the bull was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the symbol of another sign of the zodiac, Taurus, the sign exactly opposite Scorpio.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This dynamic can express itself in love or hatred. Love brings family continuation. Hatred is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain intended to protect the family. If the mate is indiscreet in sexual relations, love may be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain translated into hatred, for this might bring survival of the wrong family. The dynamic causes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compulsions. When dominated by it, individuals do not understand or control their own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain behavior. They are automatons. A harmless incident may be followed by rage due to faulty\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning on the part of the unconscious interpretive apparatus. It may be much as if a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain demon has taking over. When the rage is over, there may be sorrow, remorse and the ]most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain apologetic reaction.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There were three different symbols employed by the ancients to represent Scorpio and the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family survival dynamic, the scorpion, the serpent and the eagle. It has been said that the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain eagle was supposed to portray the higher manifestations of Scorpio, the Scorpion was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain supposedly representing the lower manifestations.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We understand why the eagle was sometimes employed as a symbol when we realize that in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain its harmonious application the dynamic produces executive ability. It enables one to direct\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the activities of others, which is helpful to family survival, for the good executive is able to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain support his family.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Scorpio can be very human and empathic rather than sympathetic. The sympathetic or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compassionate person may suffer pain upon seeing someone wounded, but the empathic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain person will act. Instead of feeling pain, he will rise to the occasion. This has to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain characteristic of the surgeon, for all surgery seems linked with this dynamic. He cannot do his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain work efficiently if he faints at the sight of blood.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Scorpio supplies ability to direct others and obey commands of superiors, often producing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain good military men. Theodore Roosevelt and General George Patton are to be included. There\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is the ability to arouse emotion in others, as demonstrated by the two outstanding\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain evangelists of this century, Billy Sunday and Billy Graham, driven by the sex dynamic.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE SOCIAL SURVIVAL DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The primitive purpose of PISCES is Social Survival. The second dynamic places greater value\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain on the family than on the individual. It is more important for the family to survive. The third\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamic places greater value on social survival and may sacrifice the individual and the family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the general interest of society.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The third is the strangest, and perhaps most interesting, of survival dynamics. It is a principle\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain overlooked by Darwin, for it involves survival of the weak. The interests of the individual and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the family may be ignored. Socialism is merely an expression of this dynamic. We also see its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain better manifestation in such organizations as The Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Animals, the Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Children, The Salvation Army, The Red\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cross, etc. We see it in social legislation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Unfortunately, the negative manifestations are more often in evidence, because the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain individual is having difficulty in discovering his or his families relationship with a confused\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and mixed up society that wants to be proper. Maladjustment in the functioning of this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamic leads to insanity and illness of other forms. There is subconscious confusion.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Primitive astrological interpretations linked Pisces with prisons, hospitals, institutions, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain underworld, scandal, fraud, deception, crime, secretiveness, alcohol, drugs, anesthetics.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When we see how the pieces fit together, they look less primitive.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The great problem here is that the individual senses the evils and hypocrisy of society and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain has no clear plan as to what should be done about them. Society uses every foul means of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain justifying itself. It glorifies itself by claiming to be an image of God, kills and eats other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beings and justifies itself by believing that God planned it that way, giving Man dominance\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain over all beings. Sins are justified by incorporating them into a religion and declaring it to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the will of God. Children are taught they must respect evil authorities and evil parents. In the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain name of God, great works like those of Copernicus and Kepler were banned by the church\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain while false conceptions of Ptolemy were upheld by the church. In the name of religion, virtues\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are declared to be sins while sins are upheld as virtues, and the individual is not looked upon\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain as proper unless blindly accepting the false doctrines. Violence, oppression, murder and theft\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are all glorified by the mere declaration of a holy war. The individual finds that to be a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain respected part of society, it is necessary to keep virtue and sin so closely identified that they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain become indistinguishable. The automatic reaction of nature results in various forms of illness\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain including mental illness.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sympathy and compassion are qualities of Pisces. They are greater than any respect for law,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain order or convention. These become secondary. The law is circumvented. The objective must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be achieved, secretly if necessary, but very often an illegal course is followed. The effort to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pack the Supreme Court was a manifestation of this dynamic. Socialism need not be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain considered as a product of Man. It is the functioning of the social survival dynamic. There is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain compassion for the underdog, the downtrodden, the abnormal, the sick, the weak, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beggar, the criminal, the servants, the employees, the lower classes, lower beings, pets,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain animals, the alcoholic, the dope addict, etc.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Just as the first two survival dynamics are often misdirected, the third survival dynamic is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more often misdirected. When the unconscious interpretive apparatus begins pushing up\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain emotions founded upon misinterpretations, there are many weird results. A sympathetic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain newspaper editor and his family once tried to convince the writer that Al Capone was one of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain America's greatest humanitarians. You will find an ample number of persons to defend most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain gangsters and criminals. The answer lies in the fact that there is some good in the worst of us\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and some bad in the best of us and a lot of bad in the sum of society. This was a fact that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Warden Lawes tried to recognize. This dynamic was strong in his birth chart, and he was the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain country's greatest prison system reformer. Nature occasionally revolts against society's evils\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in strange ways.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The ancients associated Pisces with the feet. It is also to be associated with rhythm. Peasants\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dance to rhythm. This dynamic predominates in the birth charts of musicians. Savages and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain primitive people always dance to rhythm and associate it with religion More advanced people\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dance to rhythm. We dance with our feet. A love of poetry is an expression of this dynamic.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Poetry is rhythm. Rhythm seems to be some form of expression of the social survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamic. L. Ron Hubbard lists the sense of rhythm among the unknown number of series.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This dynamic became extremely strong in 1933, and the country was swept by new social\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain legislation in an effort to protect "the forgotten man." Much of it survived and became a part\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of society, but other parts3 such as the National Recovery Act, fell by the wayside. In our own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain country, waves of people turned to Stalin Communism, evidence of poor functioning on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain part of the unconscious interpretive apparatus. The motive may have been worthy but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain resulted from unconscious misinterpretation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The pathological liar is not a willful liar. He is not conscious that he is not telling the truth. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is having trouble with this dynamic. We have many pathological liars. They prove quite\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain successful in sel1ing and in advertising. Business men seek them out.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When this dynamic functions healthily, the psychic faculty results. There is the ability to read\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the minds of others, while dreams may be accurate video of what is occurring elsewhere. One\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may tuning into Jung's collective unconscious.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When the dynamic is functioning improperly, one's social relations present problems, and a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hunger develops, a hunger for cigarettes, alcohol or drugs. There is an attempt to escape.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In an effort to overcome the enemies of' society, or those persons momentarily interpreted to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be enemies of society, the method is not a frontal attack, but one to trick, ensnare, deceive,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain trap, persuade, suggest, hypnotize and overcome with propaganda. We see this dynamic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning daily in international relations. We fill our State Department with people in whom\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this dynamic is powerful, at times with abnormal results.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This dynamic was strong in the birth chart of Luther Burbank, who reformed botany and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain treated flowers like children. He talked to them, and maintained that they responded to his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain love and affection.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Too often, lofty motives are without means of achievement, and they are said to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain impractical. They are impractical when they ignore the existence of the first and second\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival dynamics. This third dynamic is often considered impractical or impracticable by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain organized society. Any share-the-wealth policy is usually frowned upon by those who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain momentarily possess the wealth. Such a policy is interpreted as being in conflict with the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain individual survival dynamic and the family survival dynamic, and both may react and function\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain against the social survival dynamic. Someone may go to jail. Every Robin Hood has conflict\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain between the first and third survival dynamics. Some very weird results follow conflict\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain between the second and third survival dynamics.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A woman client who had inherited a good deal of money and had no cause for any fear or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain insecurity was considerably mixed up. Surgery had been employed to remove her gall bladder\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and appendix, which had grown faulty, but she continued confused. Her birth chart showed a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain terrific conflict between the second and third survival dynamics, a conflict between social\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival and family survival.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain She confessed that throughout her marital life she had committed continuous adultery with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain numerous men, and that her four children were of different fathers. She covered her\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain indiscretions well. She was unsuspected by neither her husband nor society, for she was a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain leader in various philanthropic organizations and highly regarded in her community. Her\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain indiscretions always involved men from a lower social stratum, often men she employed.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We begin to see light when she tells us that her behavior was not so much the result of any\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sex passion as the result of a deep feeling within her own emotions that men needed her. It\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain gave her satisfaction to believe that she was filling a social need. Unconsciously, she was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain helping men continue the existence of families. It was a sort of communistic family institution.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain She had the money to support the children.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The symbol for Pisces was two fish attempting to swim in opposite directions but tied\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain together by reeds. You can draw your own conclusions about what this symbol was intended\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to portray. It might illustrate the inability of individuals to function as such, since they are tied\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain together within the emotions (Water) by the social survival dynamic. The individual finds it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain impossible to function alone because he is part of society whether he wishes to be or not.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In the accompanying diagram, we have emphasized the Water signs. The triangle in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain zodiac referred to as the Water Triplicity represents the life survival dynamics. Opposite each\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Water sign is an Earth sign. Water is always opposed by earth in the zodiac. The Water and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Earth signs together can be represented by the six-pointed star, made by overlapping two\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain triangles. We find it atop every Jewish Synagogue.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain As you study these three basic life dynamics you will realize that we are dealing with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain something very deep in nature, something that has been functioning for thousands of years,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain without folks knowing much about it, although the ancients appear to have known about it.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain You will ultimately watch these dynamics function mathematically and geometrically, and you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain will realize how crude is a society that attempts to control itself and its destiny without\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mathematical or other knowledge of these dynamics. Left to fight it out among themselves,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these dynamics might result in annihilation rather than survival, but nature has provided a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain system of shock absorbers to condition the functioning and prevent it from getting\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain completely out of hand. These shock absorbers are the Earth Sighs. An Earth Sign is always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there, opposite a Water Sign. In our next lesson, we will deal with these EARTH SIGNS.\par
\page
\pard\qc\f0\fs28\b Correspondence Course in Astrology\par
\pard\qc\f1\fs22\i by Carl Payne Tobey\par
\pard\qc\f0\fs26\b Lesson #3\par
\pard\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Survival Dynamic ReactorsIf you see a sign which reads SPEED LIMIT 25 MILES, it can be an omen of what might\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain happen if you drive at seventy. The word SIGN means OMEN, and thus the term SIGNS OF\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE ZODIAC.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have introduced you to the three survival dynamics as represented by the WATER or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain EMOTIONAL signs of the zodiac. The ancients were ahead of us in their recognition of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamics, but they didn't call them dynamics. They called them gods.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Across the circle from, or opposite to, each WATER sign is an EARTH sign. IT IS THE\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b PURPOSE OF THE EARTH SIGNS TO CONTAIN THE SURVIVAL DYNAMICS.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In physics, we are told that to every ACTION there is REACTION. The WATER signs\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain represent ACTION within the survival dynamics, and the EARTH signs represent REACTION.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Earth signs are reactionary.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have illustrated that the survival dynamics often lack inte1ligent direction and can get out\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of hand, as in the case of the man who had a bad day at work and went home and beat up his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain wife or one of the children. Nature has set up an interesting set of REACTORS, one opposite\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain each survival dynamic, to contain these dynamics and keep them within safe limitations (an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Earth sign opposite each Water sign).\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Water has no form, and it will run off in any and all directions when it has no container. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ancients saw the parallel. Emotion was without form, and it might run anywhere when not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain contained. Thus, emotion resembled water, and we have the WATER signs. Earth had form.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain You could put earth around water and contain it. You could build dams out of earth. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain restrictive oppressive signs of the zodiac became the EARTH signs.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is the function of the EARTH signs to organize and give form. They relate to one's ability to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fit into one's environment which is that which is already organized and has form. They\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain provide the means for self-control, and in excess, they represent frustration. While the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain EARTH signs have a very valuable function, when their influence is excessive the tendency is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not to survive but to succumb, to give up all hope.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The EARTH signs develop a sense of duty, a sense of responsibility, and when this is carried\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to excess, the results can be negative. It can result in ill health. There is need for the EARTH\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain signs. It is necessary that we regulate our behavior, but we cannot bottle up the survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamics. In regulating force, it is essential that we give it a useful outlet.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The EARTH signs can be identified with a phenomenon bearing a close resemblance to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain memory, but much broader in scope than memory. Things are recorded somewhere. Modern\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain biologists might say in the cells, but we won't say. Ultimately, we will present a piece of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain evidence that will indicate that this factor akin to memory may extend back over thousands\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of years. It may have something to do with heredity. Emotion causes action, but eventually,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there is reaction, and between this cause and effect) there has to be a record that is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain continually maintained.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The REACTORS (Earth Signs) operate or do not operate depending upon what is going on in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the solar system. They all operate eventually, but they are often delayed, which is expressed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the saying, "The mills of the gods grind slowly but exceedingly find." We can think of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain emotional cause and reactive effect, but the time difference between cause and effect is not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a constant but a variable that is conditioned in accord with various relationships in the solar\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain system. Cause and effect can sometimes be separated by wide spans of time. A cause in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain life of the father may have its effect in the life of his son or in the life of his grandson.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When dealing with the six WATER and EARTH signs, we are dealing with the effect of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain past on the present or future. We come into an established environment at birth. We face\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heredity, rules, regulations, habits, conventions, traditions, laws and legal circumstances. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the inclination of the EARTH signs to accept what has been developed in the past without\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain protest, to adjust self in order to conform, to cling to and follow in the footsteps of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain parents, to worship the forefathers and consider their views as wisdom, to take an interest\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and pride in history, and to be oppressed.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This half of the zodiac must be identified with the past, while the other half must be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain identified with the future. In the zodiac, nature divides the past from the future, and this is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain going to give us reason to re-evaluate our conception of TIME. The unconscious of some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people functions with data from the past, while the unconscious of other people functions\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with data from the future. A man may alter his whole life when he re-evaluates his conception\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of TIME.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The diagram above should give you something to think about.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In her own way, working through the EARTH signs, nature attempts to establish order and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain justice, but the functioning can often be crude and primitive, possibly because, despite her\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain good intentions, nature does not obtain too much help from conscious Man.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Just as we have an equilateral triangle in the zodiac, made up of the three WATER signs, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have a second equilateral triangle in the zodiac, made up of the three EARTH signs, and as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we have shown (Lesson 2) these triangles form the six-pointed star that is found frequently in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ancient symbology. The three EARTH signs are as follows:\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b CAPRICORN opposite CANCER\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b TAURUS; "SCORPIO\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b VIRGO " PISCES\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE INDIVIDUAL SURVIVAL DYNAMIC REACTOR\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CAPRICORN (Opposite Cancer, the Individual Survival Dynamic) represents the Individual\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Survival Dynamic REACTOR.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b IT IS THE PURPOSE OF THIS REACTOR TO CONTAIN THE INDIVIDUAL SURVIVAL\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b DYNAMIC.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Before you arrived, the struggle for food had been going on for thousands of years. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain civilization had been building up, and when you came along you faced an environment.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Certain things were expected of you, and if you conformed, you were allowed to eat. There\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain were times when you may not have wanted to conform. What did you do? Did you conform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain anyway? If you did, there was a certain amount of frustration in your life. Perhaps you took\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain care of an old uncle untill he died, and perhaps he left you some stocks and bonds or some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain real estate in his will. You may have been rewarded, but you paid a very high price, because\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you frustrated yourself. You didn't allow other parts of your nature to grow and manifest. You\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are now dependent upon those stocks and bonds, but it is too late to do much about it,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unless you re-educate yourself, and unless you completely re-evaluate your past and become\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious of what you did to yourself. If you can do this, there is still a chance for freedom.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain But, perhaps you did not frustrate yourself and perhaps the outcome was different. When a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain person is born strongly under Capricorn, it is the tendency to give in to one's oppressor, to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conform, to adjust one's self to the environment, to be a good boy, to save and be thrifty, to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accept authority, to curb one's appetites and keep them under control, to do the unpleasant\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things in life because they have to be done, to place great value on material quantities, to do\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things the hard way, to be the goat, possibly to rise to high places only to wear one's self out\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and succumb, to turn away from anything that promises quick and easy profits on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain grounds that any such promises are unsound and the profits highly improbable, to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pessimistic and depressive, to always see the negative possibilities and try to insure against\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain them without being able to see more favorab1e possibilities, to take a dark view of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future, to be sound and practical and to judge the future by the past.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In a great many cases, we find the person, in whose birth chart this Capricorn REACTOR is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strong, very successful in early life. He meets with the approval of older people wherever he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain goes. His reliability is valued. His responsibility is something that is noted. He is pushed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain forward by older men, because they can depend on him. He develops good contacts, but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there comes a day when these older men begin to die off. More and more of them die off.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Ultimately, Capricorn is surrounded by younger men. He continues to live according to the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain rules of the old masters. The younger men are without respect for these old masters and are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unimpressed. His views are considered obsolete and reactionary. He is no longer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain appreciated, but instead, is regarded as an obstacle. Others feel that his usefulness has been\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain served. He doesn't fit into the new order of things. He can't understand it. "After all, the world\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain got along for a long time without these new-fangled ideas. These young men are apt to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain wreck the world. They are unsound." He feels that they lack experience. If old Mr. Goat were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain still alive, he would tell them, but Mr. Goat died some time back and can't influence things\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain now.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CAPRICORN no longer fits into the picture. The world's evaluation of him has been deflated.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He is a sad man. He is very depressed. There is no longer a place in the world for him.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Statistics have shown that the manic depressive is born strongly under this Capricorn\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b REACTOR.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CAPRICORN is the goat of the zodiac, and the ancients symbolized this sign with the goat,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the scapegoat. The word CAPRI means "of the goat family." The word SCAPE means escape,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the word scapegoat is of antique Jewish origin. The sins of the people were symbolically\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain placed on the head of the goat, after which he was suffered to escape into the wilderness. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain scapegoat is a person or a thing bearing blame for others, and this is typical of the Capricorn\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain personality. Capricorn is identified with the planet Saturn, from which grows the word\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Saturnian, which usually implies seriousness and lack of frivolity, but one dictionary gives the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain word as meaning a golden age, marked by peace, happiness and contentment. This is what\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Capricorn seeks by conforming to things as they are.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is interesting to note the professions with which astrologers have associated CAPRICORN.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They include: undertakers, lawyers, printers, coal miners, farmers. This dynamic is very strong\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the charts of professional people, doctors, ministers, 1awyers, teachers, etc., but this need\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not be true indefinitely. It is true only to the extent that they are conformists and seekers\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain after security. This REACTOR is strong in the minister who tries to interpret the Bible literally,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the doctor who worships the American Medical Association as a god, the lawyer who sees\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain only the letter and not the spirit of the law, and the teacher who never sees a truth unless it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may have found its way into an established and approved textbook.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CAPRICORN has long forgotten why he is as he is. He has forgotten his original discovery\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that you can eat more readily when you conform. Life is now merely a matter of HABIT. His\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain thinking is a matter of habit. He has no new records. The same old ones are played over and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain over and over, down in his unconscious. He is dominated by what Ron Hubbard calls THE\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain REACTIVE MIND. He is filled with prejudices and conditioned reflexes.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He is suspicious. In each new situation, he sees a parallel. If he was once swindled by a man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain named Thompson, no other man named Thompson is going to swindle him. In his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconscious, Thompson equals a swindler, and although he is not conscious of his reasons for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain doing so, he "instinctively" dislikes any man named Thompson. It seems to be that same\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Thompson in disguise. If he were swindled by a Spaniard, then he may develop a prejudice\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain against all Spaniards.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Most courts of justice are Capricornian. Cases often drag on and on. Justice may operate, but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain it may take years. Cases are postponed and postponed. Meanwhile, witnesses die. Principles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain die. When the case is finally won, if it is won, perhaps only the descendants gain any benefit,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but first, a large part of the winnings must go to pay the lawyers.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The danger of Capricorn lies in the possibility that the ego may die. The life force fails to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain flow. Yet, if we are to have law and order, we must have Capricorn. We must have people to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain assume responsibility, but nothing should be overdone. Capricorn is inclined to overdo it.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain New ideas are no longer explored. There is no spirit, except that which comes in bursts, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain which must be followed by equalizing depression. Anything that would disturb the status quo\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is viewed as evil. "Why change things? We have always done it this way. This textbook has\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain been selling for twenty years. It taught me everything I know, Why do you want a new one\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain now? Can't you leave well enough alone? Why disturb the people?"\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CAPRICORN may ultimately reach a point where he is unable to visualize the future. He lives\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and re-lives the past. He dreams of the good old days. (Like Ashley in "Gone with the Wind.")\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is nothing to which to look forward. The mind can look in one direction backward, into\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the past.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Keep in mind that the first survival dynamic is in the back of all this. Nature is still trying to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain overcome the possibility of food short-age. There is no conscious thought about these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain matters now. The work is all being done in the unconscious. The old records are being played.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In place of conscious thinking we have habit. There is obsession. There is unhappiness and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain depression. The life force is subdued. "How can you get along without the past? If people are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not going to do things as they were done in the good old horse and buggy days, how can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they survive? What is the use of trying to survive? There is no father and no mother. How can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one survive without a father or mother, or without the old boss who was so wise?"\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The past has been identified with individual survival. In the "reactive mind," PAST equals\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain SURVIVAL and FUTURE equals NON-SURVIVAL. This leaves the individual without hope.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is nothing left but to succumb. One takes cold more easily. One can get sick more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain easily. Dominated by the above unconscious reasoning, the life force is no longer plugged in.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The mind doesn't fight back. The body doesn't fight back. Deterioration and disintegration\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have set in. It is an obsession when you don't believe you can get along without the past, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain such an obsession is destructive. Unconsciously, people get locked in the past. They display\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain no interest in the future. They may talk about all their accomplishments of the past. They are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain constantly re-lived, but the future is no longer visualized. Instead, it is merely anticipated with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fear.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The ancients associated Capricorn with the knees, the bones, the teeth, the skin and the hair.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The skin arid the hair are parts of the body that are being discarded. Decay of the teeth\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seems to be cyclic and to be associated with the functioning of this reactor. The young\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain person strongly under the influence of this reactor appears to have skin disorders. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain person born when Capricorn is at the eastern horizon or ascendant often seems to have an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain odd walk due to some factor concerning the knees.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The philosophy that is conditioned by this reactor often causes a person to buy at the top. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is cautious. He will not buy stock until its value has been proved. When earnings have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reached their high point, he has finally become convinced. The stock is valuable, so he finally\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain buys it, for he sees it as established. Just about that time, a new invention changes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain everything. The stock has reached its apex and decline sets in.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Let us not lose sight of the original, basic function of this reactor, the sign Capricorn. It has\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purpose, and the purpose is good. To some extent, it is necessary to conform to our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain environment. To some extent it is necessary to benefit from past errors and keep life well\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain organized, but if we are to continue to survive, we must also be interested in changing our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain environment to conform to the future. We must not allow ourselves to become locked in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain past. We must live a good part of or mental lives in the future. The man who is constantly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain working to complete what he visualizes to exist in the future is a much happier man. He is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain also a healthier man. We must have good balance between our consciousness of the past and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain our consciousness of the future. We must have hope and faith in the future, because these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain allow the life force to manifest. "Where there is life, there is hope." When we have faith and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hope, we have the energy to do something about the future. On the other hand when we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain assume that FUTURE equals FAILURE, the life force no longer flows through us. There is no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain energy with which to approach the future. There is only despair. We are afraid to ask for help\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain from others, because we assume they will turn us down. "Why try? Why do anything if we are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to fail anyway? Why have anymore failures? The only alternative is to succumb."\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE FAMILY SURVIVAL DYNAMIC REACTOR\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain TAURUS (opposite Scorpio, the Family Survival Dynamic) represents the Family Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic Reactor. IT IS THE PURPOSE OF THIS REACTOR TO CONTAIN THE FAMILY\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b SURVIVAL DYNAMIC.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Before you arrived, the family had been perpetuated for a long time. You arrived with some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heredity. You resembled your parents. A being whose parents were dogs will look like a dog.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Regardless of any planetary setup existing at the time, he will not look like a kangaroo. There\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is no conflict between heredity and astrology. The two work together. A boy may look like his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain father, but not look exactly like his father. Time changes things. In his characteristics, the boy\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may be quite different from his father. Again, there are two forces at work. One resembles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain habit. One force is attempting to reproduce a new product from the old mold, but another\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain influence is altering the pattern. There is evolution. The planetary setup at the moment of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain birth represents the difference between father and son, rather than the resemblance. Yet, it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would seem that there is some tendency for children to be born at those times when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planetary conditions, prevalent at the time of the parent's births, repeat themselves. Since\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planetary patterns never repeat themselves exactly within millions of years, it becomes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain impossible for a child to be exactly like his father or mother. We might mention that we have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain quite a number of cases where two people, born on the same month, day and year, married,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the first child was born on the parent's birthday. In one instance, there were three\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain children. The first and third had the same birthday as the parents, while the second was born\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exactly six months from that date.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In order for the family to survive, there must be reproduction. The Family Survival Dynamic is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain often without direction. It will function anywhere, any time. It wants outlet regardless. It may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain carry a man to houses of prostitution. The Family Survival Dynamic is also working through\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the girls in the houses of prostitution, but it is not accomplishing mg its purpose.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Nature recognized the need for a curb, and she provided TAURUS, Family Survival Dynamic\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b REACTOR.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When you came along, you probably faced a family environment. There may have been a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mother and father, grandparents, uncles, aunts, etc. To a greater or lesser extent, all of these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people had an interest in you. They were protective. There was also a home. To that home,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you may have become very attached. It was safety. It protected you from weather. It was a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fort. If something chased you, you ran home. Nothing could get you when you were home.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain None of those imaginary things could get you there. You were safe when you were home,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain particularly when you were in bed. Children often associate a warm bed with safety. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain greatest place safety is home in bed, where there is nothing to fear. One can rest go to sleep\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in complete safety.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Out of all this grows love of family and love of home. This can be extended to love of real\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain estate, love of land. All of this is associated with Taurus. Sex is without form. The family must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have form. It must have a home, a fort, a place of safety. The family environment is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain limitation to sex. The home environment becomes established, a part of you. It influences\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain habits. When you try to select a mate, there is an unconscious urge to select one who will fit\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain into the family environment. This is the operation of the Family Survival Dynamic REACTOR --\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Taurus.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If this REACTOR is not strong, things do not work out this way. One may not love the home\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the parents. Any attachment may be very weak.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Out of this REACTOR grow the characteristics we have associated with Taurus. Certain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain characteristics are the reverse of what we find in Scorpio. Instead of impulsiveness, we have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sluggishness. Sex reactions are delayed. The force is stored up, but it is more powerful when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain finally released. Anger is aroused with difficulty, but when finally released is far more intense.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The ancients symbolized the sing with the bull. Remember the story of the old buffalo bull,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain who fights to the death, sacrificing individual survival, in endeavoring to preserve the family.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When Taurus finally agrees to fight, it is a fight with complete annihilation as its objective.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Unless interrupted, such may be the result. This seldom happens because it is rare that there\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is sufficient cause to arouse this king of a Taurus reaction.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Taurus likes big homes, lots of land. It is all part of an unconscious building of a fort to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain protect the family. Taurus likes to do everything in a big way. Whether he is prosperous or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not, he is apt to look prosperous. He is a builder. His original inclination to build a fort may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain take other forms He might be a contractor. He makes a good engineer. He understands\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain weight, volume and density. He likes to be big himself. He thinks in terms of quantity. He likes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things when they are big. This all stems from the original purpose of building a big fort to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain protect the family. Taurus is FIXED EARTH. The bigger the fort the greater the family security\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the greater the opportunity for family survival.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although TAURUS may take on the family virtues, it is just as easy to take on the family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain faults. There is an unconscious urge to imitate the parents or grandparents, to acquire their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain habits, to continue their traditions. There may be hesitation about marrying into another's\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain race. It seems more secure to marry your own kind." There may be little desire to improve\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heredity. There may be too much consideration for what the family may think. There may be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a lack of initiative, because it is more comfortable at home with the family, where one can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sleep. There seems to be a voice that constantly says, "Don't do what the family would not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain want you to do." When asked why he never married, an elderly bachelor told us, "I thought a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain great deal of my family. I never felt that I could marry any girl who would meet the approval\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of the family, and I knew well that my family could never approve of the kind of a girl I would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain want to marry."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There can be inability to get away from the old part of the family, and go forth to produce\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the new family in a new home. Such ties are not easily broken. They can be carried to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain extremes. It may be difficult to accept new ideas. The old Family ideas have long, deep roots.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Taurus wants to be proud of his heredity. He is likely to know as much as possible about his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain genealogy, Stubbornness is a characteristic. Taurus can be sluggish and slow to grasp things.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It may take much education before he can grasp the abstract side of things. He is coming out\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of a fog. He may become a prisoner of dogma. Yet, he can be the worst enemy of dogma,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because he will fight dogma with dogma.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is difficult for Taurus to change purpose in life, and the original purpose was limited by the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family environment, but once a purpose has developed there is blindness to all else. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interesting to note how many big, scientific or philosophical books have ultimately come from\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the pens of Taureans like Spencer, Freud, Marx, Lester Ward, Emmanuel Kant, Spinoza, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain even Hitler with is his "Mein Kampf."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain William Randolph Hearst ; was a Taurean, and the empire he built was characteristic of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sign. His Mexican ranch was the equivalent of an empire itself. It was so strongly fortified\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with its own army of cowhands, that it was the one point within Mexico where Pancho Villa\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dared not attack. It was a perfect dream of the Taurean. The family would be safe in a place\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain like that.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The characteristics of Taurus people will be more easily understood when you realize what is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain causing them on the unconscious plane, what nature is trying to do. This is the Family Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic REACTOR at work. It is trying to keep the Family Survival Dynamic contained and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain under control. It is trying to keep the family as it was. It is attempting to perpetuate the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family according to the same old pattern that had existed in the past. As with the First\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Survival Dynamic Reactor this can ultimately lead to frustration.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE SOCIAL SURVIVAL DYNAMIC REACTOR\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain VIRGO (opposite Pisces, the Social Survival Dynamic) represents the Social Survival Dynamic\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b REACTOR. IT IS THE PURPOSE OF THIS REACTOR TO CONTAIN THE SOCIAL SURVIVAL\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain DYNAMIC. In Lesson Three, we saw that sympathy, compassion, and a charitable attitude\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain toward the weak and afflicted are characteristics of the Social Survival Dynamic.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Nature appears to have understood that if you give everything to the weak, the result is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain disintegration. Sympathizing with the weak and suffering with them is not a cure, and so\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nature provided a REACTOR to contain these emotional qualities. A man is too weak to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survive. First, we try to cure him. We give him medical or other attention, and then, we try to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find him a job and make him a slave.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The ancients associated VIRGO with the intestines, arid it is interesting to note that modern\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain slang fits into this symbolism, too. When a man is too weak to function properly, modern\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain slang tells us that he hasn't any guts. Astrology has associated VIRGO with the working class,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the laborers, labor unions, also with diets, medicine and attempts to heal.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain As in the case of all the EARTH signs, VIRGO strives to be practical. If you have a sick man,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain make him well. make him useful. Find him a job. Get him functioning. make use of his physical\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain anatomy. Turn him into a productive factor. make him some kind of a slave. That is being\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain practical.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Virgo people as a whole are workers, often to the point of frustration. They are efficient.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Being close observers, they don't miss any details. They do a good job. They make the most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain valuable employees.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They concentrate and keep their minds on what is to be accomplished. You seldom go wrong\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when you hire a Virgo employee. There is great power of concentration, which is the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain opposite of a characteristic found in connection with the Social Survival Dynamic itself\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain (Pisces). Pisces is a dreamer, misses the details, but observes the broader pattern of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whole. Somebody has to do the work, and VIRGO is there, waiting to carry on.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain "All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is the inclination of Virgo to over-work, to exclude all else. The work to be done assumes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain too great a significance. Work becomes habit. It becomes automatic. A way of doing a job is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain learned, and from then on, each day is the same old grind. There may be new and better\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ways of doing the job as production methods make it possible to do the same job better with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain half the labor, but this idea is resisted, on the grounds that it will put people out of work. Old\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain methods must be retained so that everybody will have a job. Everybody must work. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purpose of life becomes work. We are told that people are happier when they are working.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This is partly true, but it can be carried to extremes. It produces a world of Technician-Slaves.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They are slaves to society. We see the same principle in the ant and bee civilizations. Our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain educational world is largely designed to mass produce slaves.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is a VIRGO characteristic to tolerate work, routine and drudgery. This means failure to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain advance to better things. Perhaps VIRGO does not like the employer and talks about him\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain continually, but VIRGO continues to work for that employer.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Neatness is a characteristic of VIRGO. The sign can be very critical. As with the other EARTH\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain signs, VIRGO attempts to establish order and to maintain the status quo. What has been built\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the past must be properly maintained.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b VIRGO IS PROPER.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is always a RIGHT way of doing things. Customs must be maintained. Words must be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain spelled in the accepted way. There is always an accepted way of doing things, and that is the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain only way. There must b~ modesty. One must wear the right clothes. Social customs are law to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain VIRGO, who always knows what is expected. Emotion is usually subdued when possible. It Is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conditioned before it is expressed. One must say'. the right thing at the right time Styles are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a Virgo ore creation This is what is being worn this year. The Virgo secretary will be most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pleasant, but you must answer all the necessary questions before you can get your name sent\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in to Mr. Jones.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In astrology, relations with those outside the family circle, excluding those which might hold\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possibilities along lines of becoming members of the family circle, are involved with the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Social Survival Dynamic, and the purpose of the Social Survival Dynamic REACTOR is to see\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that these relations are PROPER, that standards of good behavior are observed at all times.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When VIRGO becomes stronger than the Family Survival Dynamic, there is often sexual\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain frustration, and the Family Survival Dynamic may never get an opportunity of functioning. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain woman must not show passion, because that wouldn't be good taste. She mustn't do anything\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that would arouse the partner, because this might mean loss of respect. Sex can be covered\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with such a veneer that the ancients symbolized this sign with THE VIRGIN, and wrlters have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sometimes associated the sign with the old maid. The VIRGIN is always shown with a sheaf\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of wheat, indicating that the WORK has been accomplished. When you conduct a meeting\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strictly in accord with parliamentary procedure, you are allowing the Social Survival Dynamic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain REACTOR to function. If there is a politician in the room, in whom the Social Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic itself is powerful, he will find a way of twisting the proceedure so that his group will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survive best. meanwhile, the remainder of those in the room will be so intent on trying to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain understand and interpret the parliamentary proceedure, that their objective will probably be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain forgotten or lost. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain VIRGO REACTOR has a very useful purpose, but it is always subject to much in the way of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exploitation. Everybody exploits the working man. His own representatives grow rich on his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dues. Honest toil is rewarded, but a way is always found to be certain that the reward is not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sufficient to allow him to stop working. Labor representatives are ever intent on getting him\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain larger wages. His wages go up and up. This is intended to make him happy, and it often does,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain until he discovers that he has gained little, because the cost of living goes up just as rapidly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain as his salary. His employer gets his labor. His union leader gets his dues. The government\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain collects taxes. The banks collect interest on the money advanced on his salary, and business\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain men have a line of salesmen at his door to see that anything left over is disposed of with as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain great dispatch as possible.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Thus, in the EARTH signs, we have a goat, a bull and a virgin.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The EARTH signs represent natural efforts at self-control. This self-control is not something\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you will upon yourself. It is a part of nature. The person with extreme self-control is born that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain way. These REACTORS were placed there by nature. Self-control is an automatic procedure\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of nature. The key to most of what we call abnormal behavior in people is found in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning of the Survival Dynamics.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These six signs were called the female signs by the ancients. They relate to the effect of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain past on the present. The Survival Dynamic go way back. The REACTORS function in accord\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with EXPERIENCE, individual; experience, hereditary experience and the experience of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain species.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In a way, we might relate these six signs to what is sometimes called the lower Man. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning of these signs is largely in the unconscious or subconscious. They relate to what\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we call Man's lower nature. They relate to the past to what is inherited. When we study their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning, we see Man as a prisoner of the past. Let us hope that by understanding his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain connection with the past, he can free himself from the past. He can then go on to better\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain efforts.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We promised an odd piece of evidence indicating that a factor akin to memory can go back\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain thousands of years. The writer's mother, having been ill most of her life, did not read much.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain She was not a well- read person, but she appeared to have keen intuition. She could sense\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain danger. When she was nearly 80, and in better health than in all of her life, she lived alone in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a house in Florida, while the writer's brother lived in another house on the same property.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain She had very beautiful hand writing. One day, a letter was received from her. In the middle of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the letter, the handwriting changed, and appeared to be that of a very old person. One\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain paragraph appeared in this odd handwriting, and then the letter continued in the normal\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain handwriting from where it had been interrupted. The one paragraph read, "On Sunday, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain visited the temple of the Aramaeans for the fifth time in the family."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain That this paragraph had been in the middle of her letter was never revealed to the writer's\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mother. Instead, at an opportune moment, a subtle effort was made to learn whether she had\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ever heard of the Aramaeans. She had not. She did not know who they were. The Aramaeans\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain date back 2000 years, and few people aside from biblical students ever heard of them.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although religious in her own way, she had never been a church- goer. She belonged to no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain church. She was not a social mixer. She preferred seclusion.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We will not attempt to explain this incident. We merely record it for what it may be worth. It\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain suggests that we are influenced by records of some kind which may go back much farther\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain than we suppose, and we usually find such incidents identified with the Social Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is important to realize that although intelligence shows everywhere in nature's operations\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain its functions are automatic, and like a piece of machinery, biology and psychology can get\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain out of kilter. It is up to us, through proper understanding, to correct matters.\par
