\pard\qc\f0\fs28\b Correspondence Course in Astrology\par
\pard\qc\f1\fs22\i by Carl Payne Tobey\par
\pard\qc\f0\fs26\b Lesson #5\par
\pard\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Reform DynamicsWe have considered the Survival Dynamics and the Survival Dynamic Reactors,. and we must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain now approach the Reform Dynamics. We have already pointed out that while the Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamics are relazed to the past, the Reform Dynamics are related to the future. The present\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain moment is merely the battleground of the past and the future. Man is confused, because he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain does not understand this constant battle that exists deep in his unconscious.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We could have selected other titles for the Reform Dynamics, but this term explains qualities\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and relationships which could not be reached by other terms. To match each Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic, there is a Reform Dynamic, and the three Reform Dynamics present us with another\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perfect equilateral triangle within the geometrical frame of reference we call the zodiac. As in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain all geometry and elsewhere through-out the study of mathematics, in astrology we always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find perfect symmetry, design and balance.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When we speak of non-survival, people are apt to think immediately of death and suicide,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but such an identification should be avoided at the outset, for when we speak of non-\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival, we refer to form rather than substance. In all probability, actual death is merely non-\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival of form, but we are not in a position to prove this. It is, however, the most ancient\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conception and the one to which the religious world has clung. The further we go in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology, the more indication we find that physical death is merely non-survival of form,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because death in astrology takes on a much broader meaning. Divorce, for example is death\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to a marriage. The child's house is built of blocks, and when he destroys it, the blocks remain.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He merely destroys form. The abstract pattern of the house existed before he built it, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain continues to exist after he destroys it. Any change is death to something.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There are three Reform Dynamics to match the three Survival Dynamics. Each is associated\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with a sign of the zodiac, and the three carry the same names as the Survival Dynamics. They\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are:\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b DYNAMIC-ZODIACAL SIGN\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b Individual Reform- LEO\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b Family Reform- ARIES\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f0\fs22\b Social Reform- SAGITTARIUS\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These are the Fire Signs. The Water Signs represent the Survival Dynamics, and the Fire\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Signs represent the Reform Dynamics. The Water and Earth Signs relate to the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain subsconscious, while the Fire and Air Signs relate to the superconscious. We have elsewhere\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain referred to the Fire Signs as the Vital Signs, and the ancients sometimes called them the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Spiritual Signs. We have avoided such a term because of its many.different meanings in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain different minds.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Man is the center of a terrific struggle. One half of the inner dynamics is endeavoring to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perpetuate the past in its old form, while the other dynamics are endeavoring to destroy the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain old form to allow the existence of a new form. When we see these forces functioning in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain politics, we refer to them as the conservative and progressive or radical elements. The same\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain struggle goes on within family circles and within the individual himself. In extreme cases the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Social Survival Dynamics result in throwbacks and recession, but even a throwback may have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain as its purpose the correction of an error, like the man who forgets some important papers\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and returns for them. The Social Survival Dynamic often functions to drag down any\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain individual who gets too far ahead of the crowd, or too far ahead of his "time." It accomplishes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain its objective in many ways. It may cause him to cohabit with an inferior person, giving the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain laws of heredity an opportunity to produce an in- between being. In its negative phases, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain often see the Social Survival Dynamic dragging people down through illness, by making them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain alcoholics, drug addicts, thieves, criminals, and sometimes by causing insanity. We often see\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the Family Survival Dynamic dragging people down through hatred, cruelty, discipline, etc.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We also sometimes see the Individual Survival Dynamic dragging people down through\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain selfishness and self- indulgence.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It should be noted that the Survival Dynamics go around the zodiac counter-clockwise, while\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the Reform Dynamics go around the zodiac in a clockwise direction. The beauty of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mathematics lies in the fact that everything is perfect symmetry. In the study of the zodiac\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and astrology, we encounter this same beautiful symmetry. Everything is perfect design.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although, as we shall later see, there are two missing planets, we can describe the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrological nature of those planets before they are ever discovered. Could we spend as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain much money as the government spent on the development of the atom bomb, we could\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain determine the posi-tions of these planets without ever seeing them.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Suppose you have a jig-saw puzzle with one missing piece. What is the shape of that missing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain piece? You put the remainder of the puzzle together, and there is left a hole. The shape of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the hole shows you the exact shape of the missing piece. Although you do not have the piece\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to inspect, you know its exact shape. Everything in mathematics is similar. Everything in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology is similar. When a mathematician discovers a formula, he has discovered a design\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When Kepler discovered the three basic laws of motion, he had merely become conscious of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mathematical design. When Newton discovered the laws of gravitation, he had merely be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain come conscious of mathematical design. When Einstein discovered Relativity, he had become\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious of mathematical design. The scientists have never seen an atom. They are merely\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious of mathematical design. They predict what an atom will do from their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain understanding of its design. The zodiac is a mathematical design. When you discover a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain quality in one sign of the zodiac, you can discover the opposite quality in another zodiacal\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sign. That is mathematics. All mathematics is design, the design of nature, the design of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstract world, because a design is abstract Higher mathematics is merely a study of design,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and that is why the mathematician sees his subject as beautiful, whole the layman sees it as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain confusion. The layman fails to become conscious of design. Finding a series of numbers in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nature, the mathematician seeks the design of the series, and when he has discovered this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain design, he can compute the numbers as far as he wants to go toward infinity. Astrology is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely the mathematics of the life dynamics. It functions exactly the same as any other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain branch of mathematics. Mathematics is an abstract science, but everything material functions\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain only in accord with abstract law. The zodiac is a perfect mathematical pattern, and we will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain later see that the planetary system itself fits into this same mathematical pattern. There is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nothing haphazard about the astrological pattern of the solar system. it is important to grasp\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the significance of astrology's symmetry, because again and again, you will be able to gain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the answer to your questions by observing the shape of the nothingness that remains in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain jigsaw puzzle.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE INDIVIDUAL REFORM DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The purpose of the Individual Non-Survival or Reform Dynamic (Leo) is not to exist in your\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain present form, but to re-form. A five-year-old boy wants to be a six-year-old. While Cancer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may cling to the parents Leo wants to become independent of them. Leo is the exact\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain opposite of Cancer. While Cancer is the introvert, Leo is the extrovert. While Cancer is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain insecure, Leo is secure within himself. While we find Cancer on the defensive, we find Leo on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the offensive. Cancer is subjective and Leo is objective. Cancer represents "ME", while Leo\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain represents "I". Some would call Leo the spiritual ego, the god within man, the life force.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cancer fears chage, while Leo desires it. Cancer seeks money and posessions, while Leo\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seeks prestige, an abstraction If you have prestige, you can borrow money. Cancer is modest\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and Leo is proud. Cancer wants to stay where he is. Leo wants to move on. Cancer thinks in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain terms of the effect of the world on "ME", while Leo thinks in terms of how "I" affect the world.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Cancer salesman is careful to deal in a product the people need and want, like groceries,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain while the Leo salesman is a highpressure man. He intends to condition the people to his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain product. Leo will see possibilities in a new invention, but Cancer will depend on the already\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain established habits of society. People have been eating for a long time. They will always buy\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain food. Cancer will try to heed the buyer's thinking. Leo will try to think for him. Leo leads;\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cancer follows. Cancer can represent fear, while Leo represents courage.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Reform Dynamics always display a dissatisfaction with the past, while the Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamics always associate security with the past. Leo is never satisfied with himself as he is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain today. He wants to change and expand. He is constantly endeavoring to expand his sphere of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain influence. He changes himself when he expands his sphere of influence. When he fights, he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain does not need a fort, because he fights in the other fellow's territory He is aggressive. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain doesn't like to wait for opportunities. He prefers to go forth and create them. Without\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain educational conditioning, it would be his tendency to go forth and take what he wants. Might\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain makes right.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Which of these principles is the more successful? Insofar as mat- erial success and the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accumulation of money is concerned, statistics in- dicate that Cancer rides at the top of all\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain signs of the zodiac, but if statistics bearing on prestige were available, it is possible that this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain condition might be reversed. Of course, a man with money may have pres- ige in many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain circles.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Leo can be kind and generous, but there is always the necessity of curbing any tendency\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain toward arrogance.Leo may suffer because he ignores people who do not intend to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ignored. When change comes, it may not be the kind of a change he expected.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Ancient astrologers portrayed Leo as the Lion, the king of all the beasts, and the symbols of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the zodiac were sometimes referred to as the beasts. Leo was associated and identified with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the heart, and when we have serious afflictions to the Individual Reform Dynamic, we often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find them accompanied by heart attacks. We might say that a heart attack is the result of an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconscious or superconscious desire not to survive in the present form. The writer has often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain noted that, prior to heart attack, the individual was irritable, fed up with the status quo, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain desirous of some kind of change that seemed out of the question to him. Life in its then-\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain present form was intolerable to him. It has been noted that, while some people make broad\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain changes under some astrological circumstances, others die of heart attacks under the same\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain circumstances. In one such case, a man was all set to make a very broad change and move his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family to another part of the country, without knowing how either he or the family were to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survive in the new land. Close associ- ates prevailed upon him to change his mind. Two days\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain later, he died of a heart attack.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In endeavoring to change his form, Leo may or may not achieve his objective, but he will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain achieve some objective. In trying to get the boss's job, he may get fired. Quite often the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain achieved objective is foreign to the desired objective. When a person gets married, change\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain has been achieved, but the results are seldom those that were expected. It is the purpose of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Leo to change, but change always involves other circum stances.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When humbleness has been acquired, it would seem as though Leo and the other Fire signs\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possess what is often called divine guidance, and divine guidance might be termed correct\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain calculation. If we can calculate the future correctly, we know what to do, and most of our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain calculating is, as we shall later see, a matter of unconscious or superconsciousorigin. Man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possesses an unconscious calculating device that is superior to any electronjc calculating\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain machine that man has ever built.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Quite often, Leo underestimates his opponent. Quite often, Leo underestimates negative\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possibilities, and is taken by surprise when they ocurr. Cancer was afraid of negative\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possibilities in the first place. The key to Leo achievements must be correct calculation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Multiple events fit themselves into the pattern of the future. A series of what appear to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accidental events occurs in such a way that the pattern of the future is allowed to develop.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Material events can happen only in accord with abstract design. The orbit of a planet is an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstraction, but a planet can travel only along that orbit. Its course can be calculated, even to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain its deviations from an ellipse. Other events can be calculated because they fall into the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pattern of design. Dr. Carl Jung reveals his consciousness of this fact when he employs the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain term SYNCHRONICITY. It would appear that humbleness plus faith in the future, an important\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain role relative to an individual's ability to harmoniusly tune into what appears to be, but isn't, an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accidental pattern. Materialismm defeats its own purpose, for it places all its faith in the past.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is successful only until there is change. Materialism is unto deal with change. The man who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain devotes his whole life to the accumulation of wealth has to leave it behind when death\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain overtakes him. At least one such man had a good sense of humor about it. Shortly before he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain died of a heart attack, he said to the writer, "Where I'm going, those nighties they give you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain don't have any pockets in them." This statement came simultaneously with a complete loss of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interest in his business, which was national in scope. He began ignoring the business, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nothing his assciates could do would change him.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When we find an humble Leo, we find a person with terrific potential. It is the nature of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cancer to be cautious of strangers or of the unknown. Leo is the reverse. He is the well-met\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain type. He is ready to shake the stranger's hand with a tight grip. He expects to absorb the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tranger into his own sphere of influence. He likes to meet strangers. He likes to go beyond\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the limitations of those who make up his environment, into the territory of strangers. This is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain part of his reformation and expansion, and while he is usually capable of mingling with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strangers, bestowing kindness and receiving kindness in return, it is necessary for him to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain careful that he does not miscalculate the reaction of strangers He may go forth, conquer and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain expand, but when he unconsciously forces his wi]l on strangers, it seems a part of nature that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain forces unite and combine against him. Strangely, when this happens, Leo is bewildered. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain something he doesn't understand. Two such Leos were Napoleon and Mussolini. When\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Cancer makes a proposal, he does it humbly, fearing that it may not be accepted, but when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Leo makes a proposal he assumes that it will be accepted.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Promises have a different meaning to Leo than to others. A promise is a means to an end. Its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purpose is to bring about change. Once the change has been effected, the promise may be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain forgotten, but it can be revived. It is something that belongs to the past, while Leo's concern\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain 's with the future. Also changing circumstances often make impossible for a promise to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fulfilled. At the time the promise was made it was an intention, but changing circumstances\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain alter things. When European nations borrow money, it is probably their intention to repay the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain money, but circumstances change, and they are unable to do so. Ful- filled promises are not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the characteristic of Cancer, the Individual Sur vival Dynamic, however, but of Capricorn, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Individual Survival Dynamic Reactor. The EARTH Signs will struggle the hardest to fulfill\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain promises, the Earth Signs representing REACTION. In fact, fulfilling of promises can often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain bring the downfall of the Earth Signs. When circumstances change, it is logical that promises\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain should be re-evaluated by all concerned. The value of money shrinks or expands, and this is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seldom taken into consideration where our courts of law are concerned. We may find cases\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain where Leo makes a promise in his old form, but does not consider the promise as binding on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the new form.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It will be of great help to your future astrological interpretation if you will always remember\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that the purpose of Leo and the Individual Reform Dynamic is NOT to exist in the present\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain form but to take on a new formand a new design.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE FAMILY REFORM DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Family Non-Survival or Reform Dynamic is represented by Aries. It is always the purpose\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of Aries to change and alter the form and design of the family relationship. The symbol of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sign was the Ram, to denote the characteristic of being headstrong and afflictions involving\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Family Reform Dynamic often result in injuries to the head or headaches.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Study the difference between Aries and Scorpio. The latter sign impulsively fights for the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interests of the family. You hurt a Scorpio if you attack any part of his family, but Aries is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more apt to think of the family as part of him, and if the family is not part of him, some- thing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain happens. There may be a break. When a large number of Aries peo- ple are studied, it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain remarkable how many cases we find where there is an unexplainable break with some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain member of the family It may be a parent, a brother, a sister or a child, but Aries has a definite\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain con- ception of what the future of the family is to be, and if any member of the family proves\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to be an obstruction to that plan, there is a break. It may be subtle. It may not show too\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strongly on the surface. The Aries child may slip away from the family, take up with others,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pioneer, and go his way.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Aries individual may move to a distant place. There is no apparent discord. He may keep\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in touch with the family and be on distant good terms with its members. He will do anything\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to help them send them money but he as his own life to live. Unconsciously he is out change\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the hereditary strain. He may marry on of foreign birth or some one quite far removed from\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain his own heredity. There is the superconscious urge to create a new strain. He may accept into\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the family persons of different blood. An adopted child may be just as dear to him as his own.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He is out to create his own empire. In this new empire, his word is law. So long as everyone\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conforms, it will be a peaceful existence, but If you nave different ideas, they are not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain acceptable They will be kindly vetoed.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The soul of the dictator is found in Aries but only within his own domain. His children are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain supposed to obey. He lives their lives. He knows what is best for them, and he will map their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain careers. They are supposed to follow this course. If they do not they are considered the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain prodigal children. In extreme cases they might be disinherited but more often, they might be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pushed away but supported. Both Scorpio and Aries can be jealous, but the jealousy\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain manifests differently. While Scorpio clings, Aries pulls away. Like Leo, Aries is proud, and a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sucker for flattery. The sign can live on flattery. It is like food. It is quite essential for Aries to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain feel appreciated. He will then give away what he has and go out and accumulate more. It will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain give him vitality and strength.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Aries does not want to occupy an inferior position. He wants freedom. He would rather be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the head of a small organization than second-in-command in a large organization. His\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain business is his child, and he will put everything into it. He will protect it. He doesn't want to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conform to a pattern originated by others. He doesn't usually do too well in politics, except in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a small community which he can control. We will state exceptions to this rule.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain You will always understand any odd behavior on the part of Aries better if you realize that it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is the superconscious Family Reform Dynamic at work within the unconscious. The individual\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is not likely to know just why he does what he does. He follows his urges. We will call them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain urges rather than compulsions. Some of the greatest pioneers in history have had Aries\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strong in their horoscopes in some way. Although John D. Rockefeller had Sun in Cancer, he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain had Aries as his ascendant. John Hays Hammond, Sr., had Sun in Aries. He built his mining\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain empire John Hays Hammond, Jr., is also Aries. With his father's fortune, he built his own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain electronic empire. Wyatt Earp had Sun in Aries. He was the most famous marshal of the old\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain west. He left a name for himself in Abilene, Kansas, Dodge City, and Tombstone, Arizona. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was forever pioneering, carrying his brothers with him, but he was their recognized leader. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain finally left Arizona and retired to California to escape what he claimed to be a trumped-up\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain murder charge. Old Doc Holliday was as much a part of his family as his brothers, and he was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always risking his life for any of them.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Aries ascendants include Clara Barton, founder of the Red Cross; Alexander Graham Bell;\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Alexis Carrel, pioneer in biology; Eamon de Valera; Douglas MacArthur; D. W. Douglas,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aircraft pioneer; and Sidney K. Bennett, probably the greatest pioneer in astrology during the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain first half of this century. Aries Suns include John Burroughs, the naturalist; Walter Chrysler;\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Clarence Darrow; Anthony Fokker, aircraft pioneer; Nikolai Lenin; Robert Andrews Millikan,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the physicist; the senior John Pierpont Morgan, another great empire builder; and three men\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain who tried to reach the presidency -- Charles Evans Hughes, Thomas E. Dewey, and Herbert\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Lehman They all succeeded in becoming governor of New York State but couldn't make the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain presidency.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We find many empire builders under this sign. When this sign is powerful, people are less\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fitted to work for others. There is strong will, dynamic power, vitality and spirit, but you will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain notice that non of these men could be accused of perpetuating the past. One Aries man did\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reach the presidency, and we still hear a lot about him --Thomas Jefferson. A second Aries\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain man reached the presidency, but he was never elected to that office -- John Tyler.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Despite the number of Aries men who have been great pioneers and empire builders, if we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain check the Who's-Who type of directory, we usually find Aries running low. You furnish your\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain own data to get into these directories, and Aries is more concerned with his own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain achievements then with having his name in these directories. He has his own realm (family)\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and he is content to rule within that realm and mind his own business insofar as the rest of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the world is concerned. Also he is quite likely to be misunderstood elsewhere. He is a patriot\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain within his own sphere.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The ancients associated Aries with the head, and when you find someone who is often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain having head injuries this sign is likely to be prominent. Aries can endure a great deal of pain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain without flinching. Very often these people are quite lucky at gambling. They like to play with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Lady Luck. They seem to have a precognition that pays off when they make a bet. They don't\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain win all of the time, but their successes seem far above average. The same applies in business.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They are often successful because they guess right. If this goes to their heads, they guess\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain wrong.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They do have the courage to gamble and take a chance. They don't base their bets on past\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain experiences, but on hunches or urges. They often have a superconscious ability to contact or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain calculate the future. They live more in the future than in the past. Where sex is concerned,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they are more conscious of results. Unconsciously, they want to improve the family strain. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not a matter of blind emotion. Scorpio is driven by emotions that have their roots far in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain past. This is not true of Aries. Neither does Aries need company. He is choosy. Unless he can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nave his chosen companionship) he would rather be alone. There is self sufficcy If there is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain insecurity, it involves only the factor of recognition. Aries would like to be recognized for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what he consider himself to be. If he is the best carpenter in town, he will feel hurt to hear\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain some other person mentioned as the best carpenter in town. Perhaps anybody would, but it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain will mean more to Aries.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It must be realized that when we mention Aries as the Family Non Survival Dynamic, the word\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family can have a broader meaning than when we mention Scorpio as the Family Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic, because Aries does not draw the blood line. If you happen to live in the household\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of Aries you have been approved, and you are just as much a part of the family as a blood\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain relative, perhaps more so. You must also realize that the motivating power is in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconscious The purpose of Aries concerns the design of the family of the future. It is to give\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the family a better design. It is opposed to, and not bound by, the continuance of hereditary\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain design of the past. There is the desire to eliminate the flaws of the past from the form of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future. The pioneering urges are an effort to build a new way of life for the family of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future.We have some cases where Aries has shown violence in his efforts to control his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family, his wife or his children. "It was for their good." Yet, he will demonstrate greater\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain violence to protect them from outside dangers Whatever the weaknesses of his ancestors\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may have been Aries is conscious of them, and he is out to improve the family of the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This is the manner in which the Family Reform Dynamic functions.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE SOCIAL REFORM DYNAMIC\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Social Non-Survival or Reform Dynamic is represented by Sagittarius. The purpose of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sagittarius is to change and alter the form and ideas of society, and the chief way in which\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this dynamic manifests is through education, science, travel, religion and reform. Its symbol\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was the Centaur, half man and half beast, a man's head and torso with the body of a horse.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain With bow and arrow, he was also the archer, symbolizing the fact that Sagittarians are noted\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for their outspokenness and ability to shoot straight to the mark . It is hard for them to hold\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain something back. What they think is so, they have to state. This is a natural tendency to teach\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what they consider their own wisdom.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We can understand Sagittarius better if we study it in contrast to Pisces, the Social Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic. The two signs are exact opposites. They may both seek truth, but the wisdom of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Pisces always stems from the past, while the wisdom of Sagittarius stems from the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Pisces attempts to preserve the wisdom of the past, and is more representative of mysticism,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain cults, churches, the occult, esotericism, theosphy, reincarnation, Karma, spiritualism, etc. Pure\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain science, if there existed such a thing, would be more representative of Sagittarius. Statistical\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tests have shown a greater degree of extra-sensory perception in Sagittarius than elsewhere\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the zodiac. The psychic is more common to Pisces.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Tests at Duke University have shown that the person with the so called psychic ability,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain strangely, makes the lowest scores in laboratory guessing experiments. Occult knowledge\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain contains value, but it has to be reviewed critically. The same may also be said of all scientific\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain theories. The Sagittarian proves to guess right more often, but that does not mean that his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain guesses are always right.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sagittarius represents more what we would call the creative scientist. He has "flashes." With a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain million possibilities to choose from, he occasionally picks out the right one. He has a hunch.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He tests it and it works. The inventor, at least to himself, recognizes these hunches. Most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain scientific discoveries had their inception when somebody followed a hunch. This never\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain happens to the average educator nor to the average academic scientist, because he is always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain limited by a frame of reference. We read of an astronomer who denies that Pluto is a planet,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because such a planet does not accord with the nebular hypothesis. Other scientists have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abandoned the nebular hypothesis as an impossibility, where the solar System is concerned.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain One science writer refers to "those amazing and unexpected leaps of the imagination in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain which the chief charm of science will always reside." ( See: Limitations of Science, by J. W. N.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sullivan.) The astronomer who tells us that Pluto is not a planet is a prisoner of a frame of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reference, the nebular hypothesis. He falls in the same category as the individual who cannot\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain consider certain possibilities because they would be in conflict with his particular religion or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain cult. One of the greatest characteristics6f Sagittarius is that now and then it breaks out of a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain frame of reference. To break out of a frame of reference is often to make a discovery.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A particular type of astrology may be considered as a frame of reference and this would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain apply to any astrology which was designated as a cause-and-effect phenomenon, but when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we go beyond such a frame of reference and designate astrology as pure mathematics we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have broken out of a frame of reference. Because one system of astrology works, this in no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain way invalidates some entirely different system of astrology. It must be investigated on its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain own merits There can be an infinite number of ways of solving a mathematical problem. It\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain isn't necessary to stick to a textbook method.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain However, scientific and philosophical progress, as represented by Sagittarius, comes in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain jumps. A new truth is realized, and a new frame of reference is set up. Although it is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain broader frame of reference, it still has its limitations, and these limitations prevent further\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain progress beyond a certain point until such time as there is another realization and another\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain jump into a new frame of reference. Such frames of reference would appear to be infinite.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The important difference to remember as existing between Pisces and Sagittarius lies in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fact that Pisces is always trying to preserve or re-establish what has existed in the past. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain spiritualist is endeavoring to contact people who existed in the past. The believer in Karma is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain endeavoring to establish causes that lie in the past.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Astrology and many occult truths have been preserved by the Pisces type of mind. Truths and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain untruths have both been preserved, but let us look at the approach of another man. This man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is a Sagittarian, an engineer in the employ of a corporation. This firm had spent great sums of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain money paying astronomers to investigate possible causes of magnetic storms. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astronomers would not turn to the planets as having an as- sociation with magnetic storms,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because that would be astrology, and the frame of reference of astronomy is supposed to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exclude any possibilities of astrological truth. Any facts that would upset the theories of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astronomy are carefully avoided at all times Such facts are forbidden territory and an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astronomer can lose his job for impartia1 investigating such facts.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain However, a privately owned corporation is outside the academic frame of reference of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astronomy. The Sagittarian engineer reasoned that the cause of magnetic storms could not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be terrestrial . It came from space. Therefore, the most likely place to look for the source was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the planets. The corporation financed several years of research, and ultimately announced\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that because magnetic storms coincide with planetary movement, they are predictable. Since\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that time, all important magnetic storms have been predicted.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It happened that the findings set up the same set of principles that had been advocated by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Ptolemy in his astrological writings. The planetary aspects were the same. However, this did\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not cause the Sag- ittarian to turn to ancient teachings of astrology. His statement to the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain writer is interesting. He said, "We have no opinion relative to astrology. We know nothing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain about it. If our researches prove basic principles of astrology, all well and good. We are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain neutral. We are only interested in the facts. The facts appear in our statistics and our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain statistical graphs. We don't want to know the astrological theories, or any other theories in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain advance, because we do not want to be influenced or prejudiced by them." These words may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not be exact, for they are quoted from memory, but they are approximate. It is important to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain realize that the purpose of Sagittarius is to destroy accepted frames of reference and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain overcome their influence or limitations to thought. The Sagittarian seeks a religion or a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain philosophy, but whatever the religion or philosophy according to which he was brought up,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain he ultimately breaks out of it. In matters philosophical, he thinks for himself. He is a reformer,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but too often when he doesn't accomplish his first reform within his lifetime, he stays caught\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in his first new frame of reference. It is difficult for him to go on when his first reform has not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain been accepted by society. When his views are not accepted, he develops an anxiety complex.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is difficult for him to be an individual and go on, because his purpose is not just to reform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain himself. Leo reforms himself. Aries reforms the family, but Sagittarius wants to reform society.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is not enough for him to accept a truth. He wants to teach it. He could go on alone, but this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain doesn't appear to give satisfaction There wouldn't be anyone to talk to. He is dead serious\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain about the matter. He wants to get his ideas across. He may not know it, but his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain superconscious purpose is to destroy the present form of society, its present ideas and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conceptions, and when this purpose is thwarted, he is frustrated. The anxiety complex is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain quite likely to result. If his ideas are accepted, he can go on. There will be another jump,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain another disclosure. Most Sagittarians are anxious, without knowing why. They are constantly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sensing something from the future, but they may not understand it. Orthodox training may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have caused them to smother their most essential assets. Because they were taught that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there is no precognition, they may smother their most valuable talent. They are ahead of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain society. As a rule the Sagittarian will do well to teach less and learn more. He has the ability\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to learn, but he wants to teach. Although Sagittarius gets caught in his temporary frame of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reference, and often meets disappointments as a result thereof, his disappointments\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain themselves are often what spring him into a new frame of reference. We will have more to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain say about frames of reference when we reach the opposite sign, Gemini.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Astrologers of the past have associated Sagittarius with the thighs and with the liver. Could\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the liver have any connection as an organ of extrasensory perception? We don't know but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people's minds do not appear to function well when the liver functions poorly.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We often find the Sagittarian persecuted for his views when he is very right, or at least\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain partially right. This is partly because of his tendency to voice his views from the housetops. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reformer can be very unpopular. When you question what is now established, you cause an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain automatic reaction of the Survival Dynamics. There is fear connected with the Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamics, and when you frighten someone, he may attack you. The writer read the original\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of a letter written by one of the most outstanding astronomers in the country to the head of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain an educational institution, seeking dismissal of a younger astronomer because he had written\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain articles on astronomy for an astrology magazine. A personal discussion between the writer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the head of the institution prevented the older astronomer's plea from being acted upon.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When vari- ous facts were brought to the attention of the man who had to make the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain decisions, he ruled against the astronomer. The younger astronomer was a Sagittarian.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain An inspection of the birth dates of German spies caught in this country during World War II\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain showed that more than half of them were born with the Sun in Sagittarius. They were caught\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely because they were too free in expressing their views. Pisces would have been more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain secre- tive. The Sagittarian is basically honest. Whatever he says or teaches whether it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain right or wrong. he believes it. A few people who were born with Sagittarius rising were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Bernard Baruch, Elbert Benjamine (Church of Light) Mary Baker Eddy, Manley Hall, J. Edgar\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Hoover, Charles Lindbergh, Eleanor Roosevelt Theodore Roosevelt, Margaret Sanger, George\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Westinghouse, and Frances Elizabeth Willard, reformer.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A few persons with Sun in Sagittarius include Winston Churchill, Charles de Gaulle, Tom\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Mooney and Mark Twain. There are less people born with the Sun in Sagittarius than in any\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain other sign. The birth rate has a low spot of the year when the Sun passes through Sagittarius.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sagittarius is not noted for diplomacy While Pisces avoids persecution by being subtle and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain secretive, Sagittarius asks for it by shouting his views from the housetops. It would seem that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the Pisces soul knows about the persecutions of history. He instinctively knows that you can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be persecuted for telling the truth. Although the Sun is in Capricorn on December 25th, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain calendar has slipped, and when Christ was born, the Sun would have been in Sagittarius. This\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is the sign of crusaders. There is no compromise with principles. We find many authors,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain statesmen and many men and women who fought for a cause, born under this sign. We often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find them sponsoring an unpopular cause, a cause that is won in the end, but not during their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lifetime. In this sense, they are seeking the future. They are living ahead of their time. They\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are forever battling the evils of society, willing to make great personal sacrifice that the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future world may be a better one. Perfection is not reached at one stroke. The Sagittarian\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain plan may be along right lines but filled with defects. In studying Sagittarians of history, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain often note that although they were headed in the right direction, their ideas were still wide of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the mark.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It should be noted that there is nothing akin to habit in the Fire Signs. Habits are qualities of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the Water and Earth Signs. Habit is a quality of the Survival Dynamics. The Fire Signs furnish\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the energy to create the future. They feel and sense the future, but there may be a lack of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accuracy due to faulty calculation. There has to be guidance and we have more to say about\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that in our next lesson.\par
