\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Reform Dynamic Guides, Part 2In dealing with the twelve basic principles found in astrology, we must always view them from\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain two points of view, how they function in the unconscious, and what we can do with them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when we know about their existence. The engineer can do things with his knowledge of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mathematics that another person cannot do The astrologer can do things with his knowledge\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of astrology that another person cannot do. It is vitally important to understand how the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrological principles function on the unconscious level, and these lessons have been\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain presented in such a way to uncover what is happening on this unconscious level. To\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accomplish his own conscious purpose it is convenient for Man to know more about the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hidden purposes of nature that he may be in a position to become a good diplomat and do a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain little trading with nature. In considering the Family Reform Dynamic GUIDE, we encounter a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain vast amount of unemployed ability. Long ago, the writer witnessed that he could accomplish\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain far better work in exploratory mathematics when this Guide was stimulated. He discovered\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that these were the "times" when he could best visualize factual abstract data.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Family Reform Dynamic GUIDE is represented by LIBRA. Its symbol was the balances or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain scales of balance. The sign was associated with the kidneys.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is quite possible that the scales represented the principle of balance in nature. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beautiful requires balance. We find beauty and balance in nature. We find beauty and balance\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain throughout the study of mathematics and physics. We find this GUIDE prominent in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain horoscopes of the best mathematicians and physicists, and the greatest mathematitians have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always been men who saw beauty in mathematics. The beautiful woman is one whose\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain features and form are perfectly balanced. She is regarded as more beautiful if both eyes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain point in approximately the same direction. If one eye were considerably larger than the other,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain it would detract from her beauty. Not all people are attracted to beauty. Some are attracted\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to the gross. Mathematics loses its beauty when we look at the type of problem found in a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain youngster's arithmetical text book:\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If a boy has $1.69 and can buy material at 13 cents a yard and sell it at 17 cents a yard, how\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain much money can he make on his first transaction? Survival Dynamics seem to dominate the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain textbooks.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Only because of the principle of balance can we compute things mathematically as far toward\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain infinity as we wish to go. We can leave the material world behind and enjoy ourselves in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstract world, but when we return we can apply what we have learned to the material world\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain if we wish to. Kepler discovered the three laws of planetary motion, Newton the laws of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain gravitation, because both realized there had to be balance, symmetry and design. We find\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Libra associated with balance, symmetry and design.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The unconscious purpose of the Family Reform Dynamic is to change the form of the family.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Without a guide this dynamic might proceed in almost any direction. The purpose of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Family Reform Dynamic GUIDE is to make the family more beautiful, to give it better balance,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain symmetry and design in its form. This Guide attracts to beauty. It endeavors to improve the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family-to-be by attracting to a mate who is more perfectly designed mathematically, a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beautiful girl or a handsome man. The most beautiful woman is often born when Libra is on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the eastern horizon. We find the sign rising in the charts of Constance Bennett, Joan\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Fontaine, Jean Harlow, Miriam Hopkins, Irene Rich and Norma Shearer as well as in the charts\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of Warner Baxter, Humphrey Davis, Bing Crosby, Regis Toomey, Cary Grant Adolphe Menjou\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and Tyrone Power.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When a man or woman is drawn to a beautiful or handsome mate, there is unconscious\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain improvement in the form and appearance of children- to-be. It is a form of BALANCE when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the male and female seek each other. The magnet attracts the needle. The earth attracts the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Moon and the Moon attracts the earth. Let us not believe that such attractions were unknown\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain until Benjamin Franklin took to flying kites, for Thales, who lived more than 600 years before\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Christ, experimented with amber and electrical attractions as well as with the lodestone or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain natural magnet.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The type of people we seek as friends is determined by the Family Reform Dynamic GUIDE.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When a young person begins to seek mixed company in a social way, this GUIDE is directing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things. The young person becomes less tied to his parents. The breaking away process is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beginning to develop. This is not a sex factor, which is separate (Family Survival Dynamic). He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain begins to prefer the association of the pretty girl to that of his family. This is new and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain refreshing, but two families want to survive, and half a loaf is better than none. Each family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain can survive on a 50% ratio. Ultimately, the Family Survival Dynamic operates, and there is sex.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A child is born. It is 50% of each family. Two families have survived to a lesser ratio.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Family Reform Dynamic and its GUIDE continually operate to prevent the possibility of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain incest. A brother-sister relationship would give 100% survival to the heredity strain. There\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would be but two parents and two grandparents. Nothing new would have been added. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family Reform Dynamic and its GUIDE are ever weakening the family influence upon\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hereditary factors mathematically: 1/2, 1/4, 1/8, 1/16, 1/32, l/6~, 1/128, 1/256, 1/512,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain 1/1024, etc. In ten new generations, there is less than 1 part in 1000 of the old family strain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain left, unless there has occurred some intermarriage of families, as when someone marries a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain distant cousin. The mathematical proportions of heredity are similar to those of gravitation,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain involving the inverse arithmatical square. The more miles a planet is away from us, the less its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain gravitational pull. The more generations an ancestor is away from us, the less his hereditary\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain influence upon us.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This example may help you to understand how two different things can function according to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the same mathematical formula, and thus produce a coincidence that has the appearance of a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain causal factor. This is what mean when we say that the solar system and human dynamics\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain function to the same mathematical formula.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain With all the Reform factors, we find a tendency to plunge in-to the unknown and "take a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain chance, but actually, the direction is determined by the GUIDES. If enough people should\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain become familiar with these GUIDES, knowledge about them could revolutionize science and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain civilization. It is two different things to plunge into the unknown when the guides are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning and when they are not, and it must be remembered that emotional indigestion\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tends to prevent the guides from functioning. The mathematical theory of probability is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain employed in testing invisible abstract laws and gaining information about things that are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain invisible. If you toss a coin millions of times, the theory will tell you bow many runs of a given\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain number of consecutive heads should occur. It will predict with surprising accuracy, but the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain laws of probability will furnish approximate and not actual figures.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If you toss a coin 25 times and a head turns up each time, the odds are 33,554,431 to one\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that there is a head on each side, but we are never certain unless we check the coin because\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the laws of probability tell us that if we toss a coin long enough, ultimately we are bound to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain get a run of 25 heads, and it is just as likely to come at the start as at any other place. Thus,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain under the laws of probability, there is never absolute proof, only relative proof. We can gain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain no proof of the theory of probability itself that is absolute. Our proof of the theory is relative.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain After we look, and we find that there is actually a tail on the other side of the coin, then we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain say that the run of 25 heads was due to CHANCE.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain CHANCE is a term like SPACE. It is merely a word to ill a gap and give a name to something\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we can neither explain nor understand. We are merely saying that as far as we know there\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was no reason for the 25 heads to appear at the start. That does not prove that there was no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reason.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A man may tell you that he went to a party, and by chance he met the girl he later married,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but if we find that the Family Reform Dynamic Guide was pronounced at that time, and that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain such an "accident" could have been predicted, it was no accident and it was not chance.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain However, not every marriage is the result of the operation of this Guide. People marry for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain many reasons. One girl marries because she is seeking financial security. When the Family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Reform Dynamic is stimulated, new people come into our lives, and this can be predicted.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Therefore, it is not chance.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain After marrying, a girl may have the Family Reform Dynamic and its Guide highly stimulated,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and a new man may come into her life. The first time, she left her parents, and now she may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain leave her husband. It's easy to find cases where she leaves husband and children or it may be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the husband to whom all this happens. Unless the Family Survival Dynamic REACTOR gets in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain its work quickly, much can happen, because the Family Survival DYNAMIC can achieve its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purpose either way. Children produced through this new setup will still produce 50% heredity,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the more children produced, regard less of the number of mates, the greater the survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of the hereditary factor. If a man can have 20 children by five wives, he has 20 different\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mediums to carry on the hereditary factor, and on the subconscious level, this serves the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain purpose.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Theoretically, the hereditary factor diminishes at a rate that never extinguishes itself or gives\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain out. If you continue the fractions 1/2, 1/4, 1/8, 1/16, 1/32, etc,, to infinity, you can never\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reach zero. Some infinitesimal part is always left.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When we can bring this Family Reform Dynamic GUIDE to the surface, we have unusual\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain powers of visualization, the ability to visualize the abstract, and this is why it produces some\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of the greatest mathematicians and physicists. Roger Babson was born with Libra on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ascendent. He saw patterns and design in stock market behavior and economic cycles. We\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find many artists and musicians born with Libra prominent, but quite often these people do\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not commercialize their talents. Consequently, they do not show up in the The Who's Who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain type of directory. They are likely to be seeking art, design, symmetry, etc. for its own sake,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for their own personal happiness. By itself, Libra is not much on pushing itself forward. Like\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the other Air signs, it is not a selfish sign. Its natives are not likely to turn into anything gross.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Stephen Foster had Libra rising, but his fame came after his death. Among astrologers who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have had Sun or ascendent in Libra, we might name Charles E. 0. Carter, Dal Lee, Bessie Leo,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Charles Jayne, Marc Edmund Jones and Myra Kingsley.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We must always remember that when we are dealing with the Reform factors, the Fire and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Air Signs, the unconscious purpose is change of form or RE-FORM.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Most Libra people underestimate their own potentials. They are not keenly interested in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain achieving fame. Sometimes they find it embarrassing, and as a rule they would prefer the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain society of smaller groups of their own choosing.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although the purpose of Libra is change, where its ability to visualize the abstract is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain concerned, there is no change in the abstract world which is therefore without time as we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain think of or conceive time When Einstein looked into the abstract world he saw everything\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that Euclid saw nearly 2500 years earlier. Nothing had changed, but he looked further and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain saw more. Of course, you can say that there is a factor of speed in the abstract world, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain speed involves time or something akin thereto. You can say that one series of numbers\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reaches a given point more rapidly than another. A mathematical formula speeds things up.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Understanding the symmetry of mathematics enables us to reach an answer more swiftly.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Understanding mathematics or anything in the factual abstract world helps us to change\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things more rapidly. A system of trial and error takes much longer.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Folks used to believe in long courtship's for young couples. There is less of that now. We are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain doing almost everything in less time. The more we know about the abstract world, the more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we can accomplish in less time. The long courtship was to make sure that everything would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be all right We can tell more about the compatibility of the young couple in a few minutes by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology than the long courtship would ever determine. Although laws of the abstract world\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain do not change in themselves, we are ever discovering new laws we did not know about\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain before. Thus, in a sense, we travel within the abstract world, and again in a sense, this sort of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain travel involves time.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Where abstract law is concerned, absolute proof is possible. To illustrate what we mean by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this, almost 2500 years ago, Euclid and other Greek mathematicians were interested in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whether there was any limit to prime numbers or whether they continued to infinity. A prime\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain number is one that is not divisible by any number other than itself and one. A few examples\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13, 101, 103, 2311, 30,031, 510,511, 9,699,691, etc. Euclid proved that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain prime numbers are infinite, because if you multiplied all known primes together and added\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one, the result would not be divisible by any known prime, and therefore either that number\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would have to be prime or divisible by a prime larger than any known prime. Thus, there\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would have to be another prime in any event. We know for a certainty that if we go on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain counting we will always come to more prime numbers. We can gain absolute proof of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstract truth, and after we gain such proof, we can apply it in the material world. That is why\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain men are flying great ships around the world.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although the unconscious purpose of the Family Reform Dynamic Guide is to constantly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain inject new factors into heredity and lessen the influence of a particular family of the past, it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not necessary that all the calculating be done on the unconscious level. By becoming\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious of the abstract laws involved, we can conduct our own speedup process and apply\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain it in many departments of life. Whatever Man can do in a year, there is always a way of doing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain it in less time if we find out about it.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It would be the exception to the rule to find the Guides functioning freely. The Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain factors are always getting in their work too, but when the Reform factors outweigh the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival factors, change is allowed to occur. The last hundred years have brought great\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain progress, but it is not necessarily true that this progress will keep on at the same pace or at a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more rapid pace. Whenever the Survival dynamics grow too strong and outweigh the Reform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain factors, we are apt to go back to ancestor worship and some more dark ages. For children to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain progress, it is necessary for them to break away from some of the fixed ideas of their parents\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and ancestors, and a great many parents regard this as a bad sign. They don't know where it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain might lead. "What's the matter with things as they are? Why not leave well-enough alone?"\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A divorce may or may not be a good thing, but what we call morals are often merely the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain operation of the survival dynamics. "Do everything as it was done yesterday. Believe that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain those who came before you were wise. Don't ever question what they said. Take Moses' word\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for it. Don't ever have a real thought of your own. Just imitate," Monkeys imitate, too.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Summing up, the Family Reform Dynamic Guide represents attraction or gravitation between\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people, and thus it produces what we call our social life. Of itself, it is not a sex factor, which\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain has to be injected by the Family Survival Dynamic. Therefore, it can attract people of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain same sex as well as people of opposite sex. Your "best friend" can be of the same sex as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain yourself. Even your best friend may have much to do with breaking the hold that your family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may have upon you. As you break away from the old family environment, you begin to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain manifest more as a new and different being. Whenever you break away from old factors you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain give the GUIDES a better opportunity of functioning. This is not telling you that there is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nothing good about the old. Far from that, but you will learn to swim better if you try going\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain into the water.\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b THE SOCIAL REFORM DYNAMIC GUIDE\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The Social Reform Dynamic Guide is represented by GEMINI. Its symbol was the twins. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interesting to note that although zodiacs found in different parts of the world differed to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain some extent, GEMINI was always represented by twins. In Europe, it was twin children. In\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ancient America, one zodiac represented the sign by a man and a woman, another by two\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain generals. There was always a factor of duality. Biologically, Gemini was associated with the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lungs, the arms and the hands. There are two lungs, two arms and two hands. It is also\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interesting to note that in the practice of Yoga where efforts are made to achieve high\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain philosophical understanding, the exercises begin with the control of one's breath. Three\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain independent non-astrological investigators in the United States and England have delved\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain into the statistics of twins, and all have found that multiple births run to a maximum in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain month of June; which happens to be the time of year when the Sun is in Gemini. The Dionne\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Quintuplets were born with the Sun in Gemini as were Mary and Margaret Gibbs, Siamese\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Twins. Oddly, a secondary peak of twin births occurs in December, when the Sun is in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sagittarius. These two signs represent the Social Reform Dynamic and its Guide These are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain also the periods when live births run to a minimum. There appears to be a compensating\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain factor in nature. When the birth ratio reaches a minimum, multiple births reach a maximum.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This is not completely true, for the low point of live births in Gemini is not as low as that in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sagittarius, but Gemini provides far more twins than Sagittarius.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have dealt with Sagittarius as the Social Reform Dynamic, and we have shown that its\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain progress is often hindered by a tendency to tie to a frame of reference, a particular\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain "scientific" theory or a specific religion. Thus, a GUIDE is required; Gemini is that Guide.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Gemini is always shifting around from one thing to another. It is a truly intellectual sign, but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain an army is needed to complete all the things that Gemini starts. As you will see later in these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lessons, we are living in a time when we cannot find the truly pure type of Gemini, and our\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain presentation of the sign will be slightly different from some of the qualities that you will find\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in most Gemini people of today. To understand the sign, however, we will have to have a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more permanent conception of its basic fundamentals, and we obtain those fundamentals by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely putting all the pieces of the jigsaw puzzle together and examining the shape of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hole that is left by the missing piece.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Gemini is often accused of having a dual personality, of being two people in the same\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain anatomy. This is because the frame of reference can be so quickly shifted. It is often difficult\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for Sagittarius to break out of a frame of reference, but Gemini must give equal attention to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain every new frame of reference that happens to come along. Tying one's self to a particular\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain frame of reference is too often identified with something akin to loyalty. A man must vote\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Republican because he is a Republican, or Democratic because he is a Democrat. An\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astronomer never investigates astrology because he is an astronomer. He feels that it would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be disloyal to his colleagues to go beyond the frame of reference of astronomy. We find this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tendency everywhere in society. The frame of reference often becomes more real to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain someone than reality itself. An automatic process sets in, and all facts which do not conform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to the frame of reference employed are excluded. This is an everyday occur- rence It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heresy to note or observe facts that do not conform to the frame of reference. People go to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain war to defend frames of reference they know nothing about, but not Gemini.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Gemini has produced many good writers, engineers, electricians and mechanics. Among\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain writers having Gemini rising at birth, we might mention Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, George\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Bernard Shaw, Alfred Tennyson, Paul Ambrose Valery, Jules Verne (also mentioned as having\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sun in Aquarius), Ben Ames Williams, Walter Winchell, Kenneth Grahame, T. E. Lawrence,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Jack London and Christian Morgensterh, while among those having Sun in Gemini have been\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Charles Francis Adams Arnold Bennett, E. M. Delafield, Sir Arthur Conan Doyle (again), Ralph\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Waldo Emerson, William Butler Yeats, Thomas Hardy, Hedda Hopper, Elbert Hubbard, Grant\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Lewi, Edward Bulwer Lytton, and Thomas Mann.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Mechanical ability is quite common to this sign, because these people grasp and understand\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstract mechanical principles. A Gemini woman can probably change a tire or fix her own car\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain if she has to. Note that in the case of Jules Verne, mentioned above, we list him as a writer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and he has Gemini rising, while we listed him for his prophetic skill and he has Sun in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Aquarius.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is not the nature of Gemini to hang onto some particular frame of reference. Grant Lewi\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always told people, "I'm not a joiner," He didn't want to be drawn into groups for fear that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they might have some frame of reference to which they wanted to tie him. Gemini usually has\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain many frames of reference and is always busy acquiring more. These people make good\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain editors. They never bore people because they always have some new angle on something.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Their interest of tomorrow is different from that of yesterday. To some people, they may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seem inconsistent. The sign represents mental change, and that goes on forever. Gemini\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people like to travel mentally and physically. A constant change of environment usually suits\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain them fine. There can be a good deal of nervousness, restlessness and impatience. They want\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to get on to tomorrow. They are refreshing.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We seldom find these people in a mental rut, although we often find anxiety in both Gemini\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and Sagittarius. Gemini natives are usually free from the limitations of any particular frame of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reference. They are free to go anywhere mentally and often physically. They can seldom be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accused of dogma. We have never had a Sun-in-Gemini man as President of the United\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain States. He wouldn't have the patience to stick to one thing long enough to get there. James\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Farley came closer than any other Gemini man, but he was selling cement and running the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Post Office Department at the same time. He did both very well.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain As an intellectual sign, Gemini finds the easy way of doing things. Unlike Virgo, Taurus or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Capricorn, these people see no reason to do things the hard way. When we see a long ten-\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain page single-spaced letter in our mail, we can be quite sure of two things. It is from a Gemini\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lady, and it is interesting and worth reading. Such letters are usually typed. They have so\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain many interesting points of view on so many different subjects. Most Gemini people are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain usually carrying on a number of different projects simultaneously.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is nothing wrong with a frame of reference if it is properly employed. One man may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain limit himself to medicine and devote his life to it. If we want the population of Chicago, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain don't have to go and count people in New York, but when we have the figures on Chicago,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we might like to compare them with figures from New York. In the academic world we find\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain too many limiting frames of reference. A teacher often judges everything in every other field\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain by conditions he finds in his own field. Because lack of actual experience, he may tie himself\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to dogmas and they become his kind of reality.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Thus, we find that the principal purpose of the Social Reform Dynamic is to RE-FORM\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain society, but a GUIDE is needed. Because he is always changing his frame of reference,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Gemini will be more likely to see the defects in the plan of re-form. He can often change his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whole slant on life in an instant by changing his frame of reference To you, the world is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whatever your conception of it may be. If your conception isn't good, you can be very\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unhappy. If you have a few Gemini people around, listen to them, and they can probably alter\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain your conceptions. It is seldom that Gemini ever lets anything become too important to him\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and you can save yourself a lot of grief when you are like that.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Most any religion excludes data. The majority of "scientific" theories exclude data. In these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pages, we are excluding data we do not know about. Whenever facts can be presented that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain cause us to quest on some of the statements we have made, they should be carefully\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain examined. The whole astronomical fraternity systematically excludes data, often deliberately.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Let us back this statement up with some actual facts.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A decade and a half ago, Dr. Bart J. Bok, astronomer of Harvard University was scheduled to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain deliver a talk at the American Museum of Natural History in New York. Word was passed out\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that he was going to take the hide off astrology. By the time Dr. Bok faced his audience, that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain audience consisted mainly of astrologers from up and down the east coast of the U.S.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Unknown to Dr. Bok, they had brought with them a court stenographer. In his talk, Dr. Bok\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain paid tribute to the work of this writer, with which he stated that he was familiar. The tone of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain his talk was, "Let's get together and see what we can find out."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain After the meeting, the writer "chanced" to mention to a young astronomer that a court\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain stenographer was present. Soon a courier was sent to every astrology magazine. They were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain told that since no admis- sion had been charged the meeting was private, that they had no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain right to publish the talk and that should they do so they would be sued. It is not likely that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain their claims would have held up in court, but the magazines respected their wishes in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain matter. The American Federation of Astrologers did publish the speech, and copies are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain probably still available.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Next, Sky Magazine, an astronomical publication connected with Harvard University,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain published a speech supposedly delivered by Bok on that evening at the American- Museum\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of Natural History. It was a talk condemning astrology, and there was no remote connection\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain between what Bok said and what Sky Magazine stated he said. The whole story by Sky\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Magazine was a deliberate hoax, a falsehood and as outright a bit of intellectual dishonesty\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain as has ever been perpetrated anywhere at any time.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Later, an astronomer connected with the group called on the writer and asked the writer not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to hold any of this against Dr. Bok, offering assurance that Bok was not responsible and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain stating that the matter was out of his hands.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The head of the astronomical department was Harlow Shapley, who probably can boast more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain degrees, honorary and otherwise, than any man in the United States. Therefore, one question\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was put to the astronomer.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain "I'll only ask you one question. Is this the work of Harlow Shapley?"\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The astronomer replied, "1t would be embarrassing for me to answer that question, and I\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would prefer not to."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain On another occasion, when an astronomer prepared a paper purporting to show statistics to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain disprove an astrological claim, the writer was able to prove that the results were obtained\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain only by excluding data, which of course was dishonest. When these facts were presented to a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain certain astronomer who was making use of the paper, his reply was as follows: "Well after all,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain his intentions were good. He was against astrology."A principle has been placed in nature to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain protect us against this sort of thing. That principle is GEMINI, the Social Reform Dynamic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain GUIDE.. The Stalin Communists did not invent propaganda. Our own astronomers are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unequaled experts in this field. Throughout the world today, the systematic exclusion of data,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in order that we may believe the world to be something that it is not is common practice. It is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain very important that we allow our children to know this for their own protection. Many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain teachers are forced to exclude data in order to hold down their jobs. The exclusion of data is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not always conscious. It is often subconscious. What our eyes may see is censured in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain subconscious. Things are deleted and are never allowed to reach the conscious. Dogma\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain works in this fashion. In the majority of cases, the exclusion of data is not dishonest. It is an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain automatic functioning of the subconscious. To vast numbers of people, their frame of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reference is identified with security. They fear having a frame of reference upset.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Charles Fort devoted much of his life to accumulating data that had been excluded by the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain academic and scientific worlds. You must never fear having your frame of reference upset.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There can be no intellectual freedom until many accepted frames of reference are upset. Man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is today a complete prisoner of standardized accepted frames of reference. They are a block\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to the functioning of the Reform GUIDES. It is unwise to "believe" ,in anything. This\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain statement does not conflict with faith. You can have faith in the future and in God. You can\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have faith in the abstract. You can have faith in your ability to meet tomorrow, and if your\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain GUIDES are functioning, tomorrow will never give you any trouble. Therefore, it is vitally\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain important to allow nothing to interfere with the functioning of the GUIDES. Progress and the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain improvement of society (non-survival of form, or RE-FORM) can be brought about only\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain through altering our frames of reference. When a mathematician as great (and he is great) as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Hogben teaches us that mathematics is a science of measurement, he is cutting us off from\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the greatest part of the truth. He is giving us a 1imitation in the form of a frame of reference.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The student is unlikely to go beyond that frame of reference, and until he does, he will never\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain understand what mathematics is. Fermat was a different kind of a mathematician. He was the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain father of a relatively new science known as Number Theory.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Fermat wrote out many new mathematical theorems, but he was always too busy and did not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have time to write out or publish the proof of his theorems. Yet, with one exception, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain proofs of all of his theorems were rediscovered after his death. The one exception is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain classically known as Fermat's Last Theorem . In Lesson One we mentioned the Pythagorean\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Theorem represented by the expression that in any right-angled triangle, a2 plus b2 equal3\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain c2. Fermat wrote another theorem which stated that when "n" is greater than 2, an plus b,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain cannot equal n. Fermat made a note to the effect that he had found simple, "beautiful" proof\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of this theorem, but that he did not have time to write it down. Because proof has been\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain found for all other theorems of Fermat, no doubt is expressed as to his finding it, but no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain other mathematician has ever been able to find proof of the theorem.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In tracing the history of the development of the modern calculus of probability, Hogben, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain person who has done more than any other to clarify mathematics for the common man,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain despite his limited frame of reference, tells us, "Today it may seem a far cry from the card\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain table to the insurance corporation. It is still more surprising to see the astrologer in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain background of the picture."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Both modern astronomy and mathematics are offspring of the original astrology, but each\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain has adopted a limiting frame of reference. In each case, progress has been limited and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain retarded by an adopted frame of reference, but in the field of mathematics we have no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain evidence that any dishonesty has been involved. The limiting frames of reference originated\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in the church probably with the best of intentions, in an effort to subdue any ideas of fatalism\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and to try to uphold the doctrine of free will. Yet this was a matter of truth being excluded by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a frame of reference From a heredity point of view, there is a factor of fatalism in the sense\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that a horse cannot become an accomplished pianist because he has hoofs instead of hands.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain You can't play a piano with hoofs -- as far as we know.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A frame of reference can be, at one and the same time, useful and a curse. Obeying orders to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain stick to his frame of reference helps the astronomer to keep his job, get paid, and support his\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family. His conduct serves the same limited purpose as that of the bank robber who also\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain supports his family. Barring the possibility of a revolution, the astronomer enjoys the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain additional factor of security. He isn't likely to be picked up by the cops, but in a revolution,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain which usually means a complete change in the frame of reference, these people are usually\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the first ones who are stood against a wail and shot. They may go on through generations,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but they are never certain that the revolution may not come tomorrow and when it does, their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain numbers are up. When the reform factors sufficiently outweigh the survival factors, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain revolution always comes. When the revolution comes they will be unprepared for it, because\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people with a fixed frame of reference have no functioning of the GUIDES. They are always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain caught off guard. They are completely dependent upon a continued functioning of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain survival dynamics and the reactors.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We live in a world where right and wrong are determined by loyalty to a particular frame of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reference. Religious frames of reference differ in different places and different churches. In a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain remote part of Mexico is a tribe where our customs would be frowned upon. They have a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain religious wedding service. When the marriage service is completed, the bride is required to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain go away for one week with the best man. It is his duty to train her so that at the end of a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain week she will be fit to serve as a wife to her husband. It would be considered as highly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain immoral for a bride to live with her husband without this training period.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain To us, these people are "ignorant," but to those people, we are ignorant. It can depend on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one's frame of reference.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain People in whom the GUIDES function never have anything to worry about. Whatever the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future may be, they can meet it. If they understand the functioning of the survival and reform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamics as well as the reactors and the guides, they can better understand tomorrow.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The astrology that has been passed down to us also associated Gemini with one's relations\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with brothers and sisters and relatives. Brothers and sisters are those in whom the hereditary\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain factors are exactly the same. Two brothers (excluding half brothers) have exactly the same\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ancestors. Yet, while they are similar in many ways, they are completely dissimilar in other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ways, a fact that astrology alone explains. Heredity explains similarities, like all the members\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of a centipede family having a lot of legs, while astrology explains dis- similarities, as in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain case of one man who is ambitious while his full- blooded brother is not.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Brothers and sisters in a family may have quite different frames of reference aside from those\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that are forced upon them by their families. They may all be brought up in the same church,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but one may change his religion and the others do not. The more brothers and sisters we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have, the more possibility there is in early life of being subjected to different points of view.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We are forced to put up with the frames of reference of our brothers and sisters while we are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain still young.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We can be more free of dogma if we consider all possible frames of reference. The astrologer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain who rules out the possibilities of other sciences that have been called occult, such as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain palmistry, divination, telling fortunes by cards, etc., has limited his frame of reference and he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain soon finds himself mentally limited just as an astronomer is limited. We are continually\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain influenced by our feelings, and it is important to KNOW whether those feelings are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain stimulated by survival or reform factors.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This completes our preliminary study of the twelve basic principles of astrology. We will live\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with these twelve principles throughout the rest of this course, for we will find them in other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain places than the signs of the zodiac. We will find them in the astrological "houses," in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planets themselves, and in the planetary aspects. These twelve principles are mathematical\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain abstractions. They operate everywhere.\par
