\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Planets aspecting these points, or even the lunar nodes aspecting these points, have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain significance. To have a body conjunct or square the node of a planet appears to be more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain important than to have it conjunct the planet itself. The node of Mars will show up strongly\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain where violence and surgery is involved. In fact, we have found but one case of a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hysterectomy to date where the woman did not have a planet (any planet) conjunct or square\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to Mars' nodes That one case had Mars conjunct the node of Saturn. During a class, a protest\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain against this statement was introduced by the wife of a physician. As a result, all the students\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain were requested to accumulate all the cases of hysterectomies they could find, and try and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain locate a case where this was not true. Many birth dates involving hyster- ectomies were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain produced. There was no case among them where some natal planet was not conjunct or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain square the nodes of Mars. That does not mean there are no such cases, and you might find\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one, but when you do, please send it to us. In fact, it will be very helpful to our research\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain department if you will send in the birth dates ofall the people you know who have found\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hysterectomies necessary. The data will be very welcome.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Planets conjunct or square the nodes of Saturn have a depressive correspondence, while\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planets conjunct or square the nodes of Uranus have a very restless and rebellious spirit. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain functioning seems to be similar to aspects of the planets themselves but more pronounced.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The north node of a planet is also called the ascending node, while the south node is called\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the descending node. No one has yet prepared symbols for the planetary nodes, and if we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain invented symbols and placed them in each horoscope, the charts would become rather\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain crowded, but you can compare them with each chart you draw. You don't have to worry or be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain concerned about their motion, except for the lunar nodes which are given in your ephemeris.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Another experience was important in our dropping any conception of astrology as a causal\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain phenomenon. The ancients placed great emphasis on the occurrence of mportant events at\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the time of an eclipse of the Sun or Moon, and having observed many world shaking events\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that occurred near the time of an eclipse, we set out to investigate this statistically. We found\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain many events that occurred near the time of an eclipse, but we also found many important\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain events that occurred at other times. Eclipses can occur only when the Sun is conjunct or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain within about 15 degrees of a lunar node.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Our statistical investigations showed that most of the important world events which occurred\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when there was no eclipse took place when the Sun was square the lunar nodes. Thus, it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would appear to have nothing to do with the eclipses, because there can be no eclipse when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the Sun is squre the lunar nodes, but the results are the same.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Statistics also show that loss-of-life through fire increases when the Sun or Uranus is conjunct\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain or square the lunar nodes. Yet, there is no increase in the number of fires during these\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain periods. Our investigation included all the fires in the U.S. and Canada where the material\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain loss was over $100,000, over an eight year period. The data were furnjshed by the National\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Fire Protection Association which publishes all such data for insurance companies. Nearly all\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the "famous" fires took place when the Sun or Uranus was conjunct or square the lunar nodes,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but "famous" fires are those where loss-of-life is heavy.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is our considered view that what is here involved is human instability. Human instability\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reaches its maximum when the Sun and lunar nodes are 0 and 90 degrees apart, its minimum\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when they are 45 or 135 degrees apart. At the maximum, people panic more easily. A very\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain great ratio of loss-of-life through fire takes place during the night among people who are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sleeping in strange surroundings as in a hotel. If they awaken in strange surroundings during\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain an unstable period to find the building on fire, they seem to know what to do. They think\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain clearly. But if the same thing happens during an unstable period, they are confused and they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain panic bringmg about their own deaths. Hotel fires which occurred during stable periods have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seldom involved loss-of-life, but hotel fires occurring during the unstable intervals have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain resulted in very heavy loss-of-life.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain At other times, people seem able to relax and maintain calmness, not all people, the majority,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but during these unstable periods, people feel something has to be done about something\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain right away. The result is that not only most wars have begun at such times, but most peace\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain treaties have been signed at such times. Many men of great genius are born at these times.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Watch Congress! Its members can argue for months, but let one of these periods come along\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and they pass bills fast and furiously. If an election happens to be held at such a time, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain result always seems to be the opposite of what people expect it to be. Any student who is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interested in history will find it very interesting to see how world events have always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain coincided with these intervals of instability. Modern man knows nothing about such cycles,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but the ancients were conscious of them. The ancient Chinese executed two astrologers\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because they were lax in their duty and failed to predict an eclipse. The ancients paid great\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain attention to eclipses, but we have no evidence that they knew about the 90-degree angle of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain instability as well.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We suggest the possibility that heart attacks are more frequent at those times when we are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain at the apex of human instability. No statistical work has been accomplished in this direction,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but newspapers often carry the news of the death or heart attacks of prominent persons at\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these times. Both of President Eisenhower's attacks came at such times.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain From somewhere has come the tradition that for a planet to be conjunct the north node is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain favorable while a planet conjunct the south node is unfavorable. Over the years, we have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain been unable to find one iota of confirmation for this conception. We have been unable to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain find any evidence that the two nodes differ in any way. The results appear to be exactly the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain same.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The important turns during war time seem to accompany these points of instability. An\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain inspection of history will verify this.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We must not lose sight of the fact that the zodiacal signs themselves and the astrological\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain houses are based on nothing but mathematcal points. They are purely abstract. They are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain based on nodes, the crossing of planes. The zodiac is determined by the nodes where the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain plane of the earth's orbit and that of the earth's equator cross. The astrological houses are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain based on the nodes where the plane of the earth's orbit and that of the horizon cross. Theso\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain two nodes are the ascendent and the descendent of the horoscope. In our procedure, we\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain place the other house cusps at equal 30-degree intervals in the plane of the earth's orbit.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In interpreting planetary aspects, it is well to first see how the planets are situated in their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain relation to the nodes. You should check each planet in its relation to each node. After that,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you should check each planet in its relation to every other planet. Do not limit your inspection\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to the 0 and 90 degree aspects to the nodes. Pay attention to the 60 and 120 degree aspects\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain (sextile and trine) also. These appear to be very helpful.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ]In Lesson XIII, we advised you to first grasp the principle represented by each planet in each\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sign. You must do the same with the planetary aspects. You can take a dozen cases of people\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with Mars square Uranus at birth and you will find certain common characteristics in each of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these people, but you will not grasp what is going on, on the unconscious level, unless you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain consider the principles involved.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Of itself, the square aspect is a 4th-10th House aspect. It involves the Fanilly Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dynamic (10th) and the Family Survival Dynamic Reactor (4th) at one and the same time.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Mars also represents the Family Survival Dynamic, while Uranus represents the Individual\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Reform Guide.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain On the unconscious level, the family, the old family, the hereditary factors, are struggling to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perpetuate. Also on the unconscious level, the Individual Reform Guide is operating in an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain effort to point the way for change for the individual himself.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This is a very difficult aspect for marriage or intimate associations. The sex factor (Family\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Survival Dynamic) is very strong. However, the object of sex attraction is not a constant. Let\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain us say that it is ever changing. Yet, the Family Survival Dynamic Reactor can hold things in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain check over varying periods of time, but sooner or later there will be an eruption.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The first effect is irritability, impatience and perhaps anger. The individual is happiest in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain motion or in the middle of constant change. The FSD (Family Survival Dynamic) is trying to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain bring children into the world. It is the aim of this dynamic to have as high a ratio of the old\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heredity as possible. Thus, in extreme cases, the aspect can lead to incest, for this would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain bring heredity survival above the 50% mark. It is quite common for the aspect to lead to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain adultery, because this will lead to a lower rate of specIfic outside heredity in the overall\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain family. If all children are by the same mate, some other family is influencing the family's\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain heredity by an equal 50%. On the unconscious level there is revolt against this.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain With such mixed up motives on the unconscious level, you can understand why so many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people fail to understand themselves. The poor conscious being knows nothing about all this,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but from the unconscious level are pushed up complex feelings and emotions to motivate the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain individual in a direction that will satisfy these unconscious objectives.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A very high ratio of people who consult astrologers by mail are those with Mars -Uranus\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain asrects. There may or may not be such aspects in the natal chart but every 21 years, on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain average, Uranus by transit will form a 0, 90 or 180-degree aspect to natal Mars. Very stable\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people survive the aspect but not without some indication of what is going on on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unconscious level. If there is adultery in a marriage, this is when it usually begins.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When people have problems they cannot understand, and Mars-Uranus aspects create suck\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain problems, they seem to want to tell the story to someone who is a complete stranger and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain who will listen sympathetically. In many cases they do not want to face the person personally.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It would be embarrassing. For them to be able to do business with an astrologer by mail is an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain opportunity, and it is surprising how freely they will write. It is doubtful whether anywhere on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain earth is as much evidence of the true nature of humanity as in our confidential files.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Unfortunately, this data can never be published. However, the Mars-Uranus person is not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain likely to be reticent about blurting out the truth. If you want details, these people will give\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain them to you, particularly if they can see that some scientific purpose can be achieved. In\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain many cases, however, the person writing to the astrologer may not be the Mars-Uranus\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain individual, but a member of the family, perhaps the mate.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If we take a purely objective view of this variety of aspect, we see that it creates\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain restlessness, rebellion and irritability. It results in accidents, quarrels estrangements, adultery,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain divorce and sometimes murder. It is something that refuses to be confined indefinitely. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain nature is caring and bold. It is explosive. Where a cure of some situation is neccesary this sort\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of knowledge isn't going to be of much use. To know that a war is being fought is not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sufficient knowledge to stop the war. If we are going to remedy the situation, we must look\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain beneath the surface and see what is occurring on the unconscious level. We must examine\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the motives of nature, not those of the conscious personality. The conscious personality is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely the victim. He does not direct these unconscious processes, nor does he determine\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what feelings and emotions he is experiencing. We must help him to understand them,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because these forces have a way of shutting themselves off when they are detected. Nature\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seems to crawl into her shell when you keep her under close suveillance. It is certainly a fact\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that planetary aspects never work the same way when you are watching them.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is a peculiar fact that Mars-Uranus aspects are very common in the horoscopes of young\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain widows and widowers. That is difficult to explain. Why do these people so often marry\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain someone who is going to die? Is not the act of marriage conditioned by a future event? We\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain often find the aspect in the chart of the mate of someone who is killed in an accident or who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dies by violence. Why? It is seldom that we find the chart of a widow or a widower in which\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there is not some very strong Mars aspect, but quite frequently a Mars-Uranus aspect.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If you have followed our suggestions about notebooks, you will ultimately have the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain birthdates of many people born under Mars-Uranus aspects, but they will not all have the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planets in the same zodiacal signs That will make a difference. If Uranus happens to be in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Capricorn, its instability will be curbed in comparison to Uranus in Scorpio or Aquarius. Thus,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you cannot completely interpret an aspect between Mars and Uranus without considering the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain zodiacal signs behind the planets. We dealt with this factor in Lesson XIII. Later, we will have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to consider the effects upon the Houses also. Never lose sight of the fact that Mars\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain represents the past while Uranus represents the future. Like many other combinations, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain square of these two planets is a conflict between the past and the future If they are square,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the sign behind one battles for the past, while the sign behind the other battles for the future,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because signs square to each other cannot both represent the past and cannot both\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain represent the future. This was illustrated in the diagram accompanying Lesson IV.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The conjunction or opposition aspect will differ in this respect. Either both planets will be in a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sign representing the past or both planets will be in a sign representing the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The marriage institution as we know it is an attempt toward stability. It is an attempt to keep\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain human activity within certain limitations, and in that way keep it under control. The institution\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was designed by Man without taking into consideration all of the factors of nature. Man's own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mental and intellectual limitations were concealed and covered up by inventing SIN.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Thereafter, Man excused himself for his own imperfect plan by attributing the whole plan to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain God. In this way, leaders of the people were able to better control the people by presenting\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain themselves as specially appointed representatives of God Himself. This was an authority they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain began to take unto themselves and to pass on to others. People were taught to FEAR God\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and in that way to fear the self-appointed representatives of God. If we are to improve the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain marital institution and if we are to improve our religion, these are facts that we must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain recognize and not hide away. A good religion should be based on FAITH and not on FEAR.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Yet, we must not throw something away because It is not perfect. That is what the man who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tries to become an atheist attempts. An imperfect plan still holds the possibility of perfection.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Because it may be partly in error is no excuse for discarding the whole. We are far from\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perfection in any of our accomplishments. When Uranus is over-emphasized in a chart, it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the inclination to throw away the whole when an imperfection is discovered, instead of trying\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to see just what is right and what is wrong in order to correct what is wrong and preserve\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what is right.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Please understand that it is not our purpose to try and tell anyone what is right or wrong but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain only to bring to light knowledge of nature's principles that we may have a better\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain understanding of the factors with which we all must deal. We might shorten thia statement by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely saying that we wish to exclude dogma. We want everyone to keep an open mind.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain To come back to nodes, there is a sharp difference between an aspect between two planets\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and an aspect between a planet and a planetary node. Where an aspect between two planets\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is involved, each planet seems to retain its own importance, but where an aspect between a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planet and a node is concerned (except where the lunar node is involved, and we will touch\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain on that presently), the node seems to completely dominate the planet. You will note that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when we discussed hysterectomies, we stated that persons experiencing bysterectontea\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always seem to have some planet, ANY planet, conjunct or square the nodes of Mars. It didn't\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain seem to make any difference whether the planet was Mercury, Venus, Mars or Saturn, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain effect appeared the same. This is completely contrary to what we find where aspects\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain between planets are concerned. When planets are conjunct or square the nodes of a planet,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the principles represented by the planetary nodes involved seem to completely dominate the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain situation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We are frankly puzzled in this respect where the nodes of the Moon are concerned. When the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lunar nodes conjoin or square the Sun, it is the principle of the Sun that is emphasized, not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the principle represented by the Moon. Such aspects bring CHANGE and instability, while if\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the lunar nodes were to predominate, we would expect the opposite effect. Yet, there seems\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to be no planetary condition that does more to express the principle of non-survival of form\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain than lunar-node-Sun conjunctions and squares.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Never be disappointed when you find that an overall principle does not appear to work in a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain specific case, because in such instances, if you are alert, you are on the verge of a new\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain discovery. It is the exception to the rule that always leads us to new discoveries. If we adopt\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a mathematical theorem and discover that it works onl 99% of the time, by assembling the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain cases that do not work we will find the pattern of imperfection, and then we can adjust and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain correct the theorem. We will find that the exceptions to the rule themselves all fit together\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain into a pattern.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain For example, we stated earlier that we had found one single exception to the rule that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain women who have hysterectomies performed have some planet conjunct or square the nodes\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of Mars at birth. That one case had Mars conjunct the node of Saturn, but that may not be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the explanation With but one exception, we are in no position to determine the answer. We\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain need many more exceptions to the rule. We have no doubts, however, that if we have enough\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exceptions we will have the answer to that one exception, and to all others at the same time.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain If you are going to help yourself or help others through the use of astrology, you must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain constantly determine what is taking place on the unconscious level. People can handle\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain problems on the conscious level themselves. If a man is being chased by a lion he has a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain problem, but this problem is on the conscious level, and he can recognize it for what it is. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain may run, or he may shoot the lion or he might make a friend of the lion, like Daniel. He will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not have time to draw up a horoscope.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The chief need for astrology is in handling problems on the uhconscious level. In order to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain remedy a situation constantly accompanying a certain type of planetary aspect, it is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain necessary to know and recognize what that aspect represents on the unconscious level. What\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain is nature trying to do with the individual's life? If a man is robbing your home and you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain discover him in the act, he is quite likely to run away. Nature is often like that. When you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain discover what she is up to, she often retreats. When nature is up to something which you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain might consider deviltry, catch her in the act and she is likely to discontinue the act. For this\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reason, many times the cure of an illness results from the mere discovery of its real cause. An\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain illness always has some purpose it is trying to serve. If you can detect what that purpose is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you have gone a long way in effecting a cure.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In interpreting astrological aspects, or in interpreting anything astrological, there are two\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ways of going about it, and you must apply both of these ways together, because one is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain check against the other. Your interpretation can be based on experience, but this type of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interpretation can never reach perfection, although it is very valuable. By studying 100\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people who have Mars square Uranus, you can learn a great deal about the aspect.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The other method of interpretation is analytical. You employ astrolgocial symbols exactly as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you would employ mathematical symbols. They always represent the basic twelve principles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of nature as we described them in earlier lessons. You employ them exactly as a chemist\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain employs mathematical symbols. They become mathematical symbols to you. Equations will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not be exact as they are in mathematics because we do not know enough to make them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exact, although this is not entirely true, because we can say that (glyph for venus in Pisces)=\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain (glyph for neptune) 11th. By this we mean that Venus in Pisces is equal to Neptune in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain 11th House. In other words, when we know what it is like to have Venus in Pisces, we know\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what it means to have Neptune in the 11th House. Thus, when you have learned what every\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planet in every zodiacal sign means, you have also learned what every planet in every House\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain means.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain All you have to do is adjust your knowledge by astrological equation. It should be noted that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this analytical phase of astrology was impossible a few years back, and its introduction came\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain first in the writer's A NEW EXPERIMENT IN ASTROLOGY, published in 1938. It was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain impossible to employ analytical methods because the "house value" of the planets had not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain been established. A "House value" had been employed, but we maintain that it was an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain erroneous house value.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In an analytical system, with a knowledge of the nature of the survival Dynamics, the Survival\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Dymanic Reactor, the Reform Dynamics and the Reform Guides, you can analyze a complex\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planetary combination even when you have never seen that configuration before, but it will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be experience that will help you to discover whatever errors of analysis may exist. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain prospective surgeon may learn all he can in medical school, but when he performs his first\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain operation, he is up against reality itself. The same with you. You most learn through analysis\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but also through experience. You must combine the two.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have stated earlier in this lesson that planetary aspects never work the same when you\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are watching then. Experience would indicate that the person who knows the existence of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain negative aspects fails to experience the negative effects, but what about the favorable\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspect? ln this case, we might say that a person fails to get the favorable effects unless he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain does something about them. Let's put it this way: suppose you have a very favorable set of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planetary conditions at a given tine. They might come and go unnoticed in many instances,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but suppose you start a new business at such a tIme? ln this case, you may get the favorable\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain results for the rest of your life. The same would apply If you have a child at such a time. In\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain other words, the same broad principle that we have expressed in our overall pattern is visible\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain here. So-called negative aspects have to do with clearing up and re-evaluating the past, while\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain so-called positive aspects involve your relationship with the future. Most aspects will have to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain involve both past and future, but an opposition or a trine of Venus to Uranus in Fire and/or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Air signs from the 1st to 9th Houses would in no way involve the past because all factors\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain involve the future, while if you study the matter, it will become impossible to visualize any\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain planetary combination that by aspect, zodiacal sign and house position will involve only the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain past. This in itself is a very interesting bit of mathematics and philosophy. Mars and Saturn\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain both involve the past. If they are conjunct, the conjunction aspect involves the future. If they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are 30 degrees apart, although the 30-degree aspect represents the past, one planet has to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be in a sign that represents the future. The 60-degree sextile aspect represents the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although the 90-degree aspect represents the past, one planet has to be in a sign\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain representing the future. The same principle applies for the other aspects.\par
