\pard\f0\fs22\b FOR Frame of Reference\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain For the present, we will limit ourselves to these 17 abbreviations. Four represent groups of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain principles. Twelve represent astrology's twelve basic principles. The last one is added\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because of its almost universal use by our students. It just appeared to be the natural thing\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for nearly everyone to adopt these particular abbreviations. To understand the functioning of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the twelve astrological principles it is necessary to realize that EVERYTHING in astrology is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain battle between the past and the future. Everything is a question of whether an old design is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain going to be continued or whether a new design is to be allowed to come into being. All\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain designs are mathematical, for mathematics is nothing but a study of design. A mathematical\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain formula is nothing but a design, a symmetrical design.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Everything in life involves this question as to whether the old design is to remain or whether\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a new design is to be adopted. When a child is born, a being starts functioning according to a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain new design. That design appears in the heavens at the moment of his birth. When a man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dies, the old design is left behind. Without life to hold it together, the old design (the body)\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain disintegrates and falls apart. This one design (a single life) is a composite made up of many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain smaller designs. From the date of birth onward, life is a battle to determine what designs are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to be retained and what designs are to be left behind, so that other new designs may\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain become an experience of the life. It is a battle between the survival dynamics and the reform\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dynamics.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain When pondering an interpretation, it will become much easier for the student if he remains\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conscious of the fact that first he must judge whether an old pattern or design is going to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain continued or whether a new design is going to come into being. At birth, a design comes into\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain being. At death, an old design is discarded.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A revelation of astrology lies in the fact that death and divorce showup as synonomous.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Divorce is the death of a relationship, a combination, a design. Death of an individual is the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain same thing. Under these circumstances, we are almost forced to the conclusion that a being\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain existed in some form prior to birth and has to exist in some form after death. Prior to a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain marriage, both parties to the marriage existed. After a divorce, both parties to the marriage\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain exist. The marriage does not exist. That had a birth and a death. It seems quite logical to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain assume that the "self", the consciousness, what religious people call the "soul" had to exist\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain before birth and has to continue to exist after death. This is not an argument for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reincarnation, for we have no opinion on the subject. Reincarnation is a theory or a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain possibility, but there can be millions of other possibilities and explanations. It need not be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain necessary for the being to exist in the 3-dimensional material world. He might exist in entirely\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain different dimensions. You exist in some other kind of a world when you dream.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Something that has always fascinated the writer is the fact that the same kind of aspects that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accompany divorce, in many cases, accompany death of the partner instead. This begs a very\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain interesting guestion. If the couple had been divorced, would the partner have lived? Despite\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the various purposes it serves, marriage is often a strain. It is a severe strain to have to live\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with a person who has a discordant chart. It is a severe strain to live with a person whose\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain chart badly afflicts your own. We see many cases where a person gets sick immediately\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain following marriage, and gets well following a divorce.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We recall a case where a child had to be placed in a mental institution, but as soon as placed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there, the child got well. There was a shifting back and forth, because as soon as the child\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain came home she became ill again. After the problem became sufficiently complex, we were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain consulted. The mother had a badly afflicted Mars. The child was born at that time when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Neptune in Virgo reached the mother's Mars by transit, so that Neptune in the chart of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain child is always on Mars in the chart of the mother. We were forced to advise that for the good\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of the child's health and future, mother and child must be separated. The child was allowed to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain live with relatives, and was soon back in school functioning normally.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain About two-thirds of the people who consult astrologers are women. Therefore, we have that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain much more experience with women. When a woman of 40 or more shows up as a client, and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain we see a strong affliction between Mars and Uranus in her natal chart, we always feel like\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain asking, "Are you a widow or divorced?" However, we are more diplomatic and we let her tell\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain us voluntarily. This does not mean that you can't stay married if you were born under an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain affliction of Mars-Uranus, but it does mean that you have to have a lot more knowledge and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain understanding of human relationships than will suffice for other people. There are great many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people who can remain ignorant and still get along, but for some people, such an existence\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain will become too uncomfortable to tolerate. The result is that a great many people with Mars-\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Uranus afflictions become very intelligent. Certainly, none of them are stupid people.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Bear in mind that if we collect the charts of widowers and widows, we find that the charts are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of a certain type. Principally, thay show an excess of Mars aspects. One woman told us that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain she was a fatalist. She had married four times and all of her husbands died. She had Mars\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain conjunct Uranus plus Venus conjunct Saturn. Did she marry men who were going to die, or\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain would these men have lived if they did not marry her?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Remember that in a case cited above, the child got well when separated (divorced) from her\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mother. We think of a man who died of a heart attack. Shortly before the attack, he told us\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that his wife just wouldn't let him out of her sight. He was under a severe strain because of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the manner in which his wife insisted on being a part of his life nearly all of the time. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain obviously wanted to get away and would fly across the country to see us "on business" when\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there was no business to discuss. His wife would fight against these trips. At birth, his Sun\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain was conjunct Jupiter in Cancer. During most of his life, he had clung to her too, but now\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain transiting Uranus had reached his Sun-Jupiter. He got away. He had been a very insecure man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and he had always needed his wife. He would never make a business decision without asking\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain her advice, but when Uranus, the IRG, cane along, he no longer wanted to cling to the old\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pattern. He found a way out. He had a heart attack and died. We have not heard from him\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain since. He eliminated us from his design also. What he is doing now, we do not know.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have pointed out earlier that a person can get locked in an FOR. Physical death would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain appear to be a means of completely changing one's FOR, but there are other, less drastic\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ways.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Illness and many other problems can be the result of an association, but often it is improper\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to break the association and cure the illness. In many cases, such a break is considered to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain immoral. In New York State, a woman cannot divorce her husband for any reason other than\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain adultry, and even this is not sufficient grounds unless the woman can show that she tried to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain prevent the adultry. There may be no children to consider, but no matter, this woman cannot\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain legally have a divorce. She may be very sick from the association, but the law allows her but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one legal way out--to die. All of this is the work of whatever dogma happens to be the most\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain politically powerful in a particular area.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This discussion is for the purpose of getting one principle across to you, that everything in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology is a question of whether a design is going to be continued, altered or completely\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain changed. Everything is a battle between survival and non-survival.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We see one man marry poor and become wealthy. We see another of wealth marry and lose\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain everything, Here is a man who married and then accumulated wealth and position. There was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a divorce, after which he lost all of his money and he has never been able to make any money\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain since.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Here is a man of very moderate means who takes a partner into the business. The partner\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain never works. This goes on for years but from the moment he entered the business, the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain company began making money, and both men became quite wealthy. After ten years of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain griping about his lazy, good-for-nothing partner, the first man threw out the partner. Soon\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain thereafter, the company began losing money and it finally failed. The original man never\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain made much money thereafter. The second man became the lazy, good-for nothing partner in\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain another firm and went on making money.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In other words, even money making seems to be a matter of a design. Here is another man\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain who was very poor until his fourth child was born. He began making money, and continued to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain accumulate wealth for the next 21 years, at which time, this fourth child broke away from him,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain refused to accept his domination, and went off on his own. The father never made any money\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain after that. His fortune dwindled until at his death, there was little for the family to inherit.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain That fourth child did all right on his own. It would almost appear that the father was able to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain make money only so long as it was necessary for the protection of this one child.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain During thirty years of astrological practice, we have served many very wealthy people of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain country. We have always been alert to see what qualifications were responsible for their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain money-making. It doesn't seem to be a matter of qualificatIons because many of them have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain no qualifications. Money comes their way in spite of anything they can do. It is unfortunate\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that because most of these people are still alive, we cannot tell these true stories. The\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain information is in the realms of the confidential. Nevertheless, although John Smith is making\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain $500 a week, it may be possible for him, through sincere effort and hard labor, to increase\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain this to $650 a week--or even $700, but John will go right on with his hard labor. If he invests\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain his surplus in a wildcat oil scheme, he will probably lose it. John is following a pattern, a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain design, and until he understands that pattern, his hard-work environment is going to survive.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain He is going to cling to it, because to him, it represents security.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Some student is going to write in this question unless we answer it now. We have stated that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when a child is born, a being starts functioning according to a new design, and that the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain design appears in the heavens at the moment of birth. If this is true, then does the design of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the heavens at the moment of death indicate the pattern of the future existence of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain being? This is something to think about and students of astrology have been thinking about it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for thousands of years. It has probably been responsible for some of the versions of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain reincarnation.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain However, to accept this idea, it is necessary to assume that hhe entity does not escape the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain solar system as an FOR. In fact, it means that he does not even escape the earth as an FOR.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This introduces a terrific limitation to thought. Of course, not all reincarnationists claim that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ALL people are reincarnated here on earth. We are not going to try to answer the question.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have never had enough evidence to justify an opinion, so we will remain open-minded.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We do not know. If we ever find out, we will tell you.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain All prime human characteristics are of two classifications, those that are intendec to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perpetuate the pattern of the past and those which are intended to produce new designs. All\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain designs are mathematical abstractions.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sex is always trying to perpetuate the hereditary pattern. The ISD is always trying to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain preserve the design of the individual, while the SSD is always trying to preserve a social\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pattern of nature that man has outlawed. You can't outlaw nature. You merely make criminals\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that way. You also make sick people that way.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Nature is going to function regardless. If you want her to work with you, stop ignoring her.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Stop ignoring what she considers to be her rights under a higher law. Man is very ignorant to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain think that he can pass laws and outlaw Nature. Nature is stronger than all civilization\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain combined Sometimes she is very patient. She can afford to be patient. She will live longer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain than you can in your present form. If you think you are thwarting her, all she has to do is wait\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain for you to die. To oppose her is going to be a serious strain on you, and you may have to die\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more quickly. Civilizations are born. They make their laws and they die. Nature outlives all\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain civilizations, all scientific hypotheses, all religious creeds. We find continents of old at the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain bottom of the sea.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain It is a battle of survival of form, but the solution often lies in recognizing nature, cooperating\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with her, and being willing to accept survival or reform when nature, mathematics and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology illustrate that survival or reform is the solution. Get acquainted with all the human\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain characteristics that people have but analyze them, always classify then determine whether\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these characteristics have as their prime motive survival or reform. A young girl is thrilled\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because of a new date. The motive is reform of family form. Lurking in the background,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain however, will be the FSD just waiting an opportunity to take advantage of this situation and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain perpetuate two hereditary patterns, each on a 50% ratio. If you will follow our advice and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always analyze things down to a survival and reform basis, you will gradually be discovering\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that life is basically much more simple than you ever thought it to be.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Yet, it's like numbers. To understand numbers you must first understand ONE and then TWO.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain As you go on, numbers get more and more complicated, but everything grows out of ONE.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain You understand higher numbers by understanding lower numbers, but as you go higher and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain higher, you will find that no matter how high you go, there are always numbers that have\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain some new characteristics that are not possessed by any lower numbers. For example,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain 3,628,800 is the lowest number that can be factored by the first ten integers or numerals.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain 435,891,456,000 is the lowest number that can be factored by the first 15 integers.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Whether you are interpreting a planet conjunct a node, a planet in a sign, a planetary aspect\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain or a planet in a house, first determine whether survival or reform factors are prevalent. Will\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the indiviual meet a stranger, or will he go see his grandmother?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Naturally, you are going to have more complicated problems, but you will understand them\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain better if, at the start, you start weighing everything in terms of survival or reform. Can a girl's\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain attachment to her family prevent her from getting married? Will she have to marry a man who\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain looks like her father? Occasionally, you will meet a married couple who look so much alike to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be mistaken for brother and sister. Was the FSD trying to capture more than a 50% hereditary\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain factor? Was the FSD trying to accomplish incest?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In Lesson XIV, we had a good deal to say about negative Mars-Uranus aspects. We selected\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain these aspects because they are the most important ones where the clients of an astrologer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are concerned. Most problems crossing the desk of an astrologer concern this group of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspects, but unfortunately, the majority of astrologers have never happened to find this out.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain They are exclusively looking for women in the Moon and men in the Sun, while their clients\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain are all wrapped up in the FSD. In other words, the clients want some answer to the problems\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that their own sex lives present. They go to church and are told to think about something\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain else, but they go home and there are the problems. They don't understand them and they\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain don't know what to do about them. What is more important, they find themselves unable to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain control them.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Let us look further into these Mars-Uranus aspects. What do the favorable Mars-Uranus\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspects do? Kenneth Brown, New York astrologer, originally taught psychology at Columbia\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain University. He studied astrology, and during the war, he became Personnel Director of a war\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain plant. He began putting his astrology to work. All employes had to submit birth dates. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain found that the employes with Mars- Uranus aspects were the best mechanics, regardless of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whether the aspects were favorable or unfavorable, but the employes with the unfavorable\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspects were accident prone.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We speak of favorable aspects. Actually, we should not call them favorable or unfavorable,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because what we mean is that some aspects involve the past while others involve the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The so-called favorable aspects involve the future.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Here is a good example. In collecting the charts of people who have been convicted of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain sexually molesting children, the most prominent aspect in their charts is a sextile or trine\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspect of Mars to Uranus. At first this may be a difficult thing to understand until we consider\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that they were ahead of time. Had they waited a few years, the matter would not have been\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain a crime. Had the sex act occurred later, it would not have been criminal. From this point of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain view, the whole thing becomes a matter of what we call time. It makes a big difference\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whether you are at a certain point in space just before a bullet crosses that point, when it\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain crosses or just after it crosses. In the first and third cases, you are safe. In the second you are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain not. People with favorable aspects are in the habit of being ahead of time. People with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain unfavorable aspects (so called) are in the habit of being late. So called positive aspects are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain precognitive, while so-called negative aspects are retrospective. While some people are\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain constantly seeing the future, others are seeing the past. In each case the view probably\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain contains much that is inaccurate. Although the precognitive factor may be faulty, what is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain more faulty than memory? If we are to rule out precognition because it is faulty, we must also\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain rule out memory because it is just as faulty. It is well known that witneses in a court room,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain testifying about the past, all who supposedly saw the same event, will tell many different\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain versions of what occurred.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain There is little doubt that some dreams are precognitive. There are many people who dream\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain events before they occur, It has been our impression that all dreams may be precognitive, but\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain there is an obstacle. The minds of a great many people can interpret the future only in terms\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of the past. In his book, An Experiment With Time, J. W. Dunne explains dreams as being a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain mixture of past and future. We would alter this and say that all dreams may be stimulated by\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the future, but they are usually presented in terms and symbols of the past.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Where you have a great excess of Water and Earth in a chart, it is the tendency of the native\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain to always "expect" things to follow the same old routine. He regards it as "common sense" for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain tomorrow to be like yesterday. In facf, he wants tomorrow to be like yesterday. He never\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dares think about it being different for that would make him insecure. If tomorrow is not\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain going to be like yesterday, he doesn't know what to do. On the other hand, where there is a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain great excess of Fire and Air in a chart, the individual thinks of tomorrow as different, for here,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the constant drive is toward change. It is the nature of Fire and Air to live in the future, while\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain it is the nature of \'a3arth and Water to live in the past. There is always the question: Do we like\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things as they are or should we change them? There are many people who do not like things\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain as they are, but they are afraid to change them. Society and orthodoxy frown on change.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Here is a personnel director who refuses to hire a man because he has worked in too many\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain places. He wants people who will frustrate themselves and stick to a routine. One thing he\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain does not want in an employee is intelligence. If the man who owns this multimillion dollar\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain company, for which this personnel man works, should anonomously apply for a job, he would\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be turned down. He has none of the qualifications demanded by this personnel director. That\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain could be dangerous, for the owner of this company did apply for a job in one of his own\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain companies under another name and worked in a minor position for a year in order to learn\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain what was going on. Nobody in the company knew of his presence. In fact, nobody in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain company had ever met or seen him consciously.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain At the time when we first began exploring the possibilities of astrology, most everything was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain based on tradition and religion, or to put it another way, almost everything was based on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain dogma. Unfortunately, the last thirty years have not changed the overall picture in the world\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain of astrology at large very much. Astrological books are filled with claims which the sponsors\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have never tested to see whether they were true or false, or how much of them may be true\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain or false. The astrological student should accept nothing until he has tested it out, not with\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one but many tests. He should approach the subject with a good deal of skepticism.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In this connection, we are going to bring up the subject of retrograde and stationary planets.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain A planet is said to be retrograde when, from an earth-as-a-center viewpoint, its motion is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain clockwise instead of counterclockwise. First, let us see what makes a planet retrograde. In\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the case of Mercury and Venus, these bodies are nearer to the Sun than the earth.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Consequently, we see them moving connterclockwise when they are on the other side of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Sun. Then, they come toward us and move (what is to us) clockwise, passing between the Sun\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the earth, going in the opposite direction. In your ephemeris, they will be going\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain backwards or retrograde.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain The other planets are further away from the Sun than the earth. The earth goes around the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whole circle in a year, and as it does, it passes thes other planets, making them appear to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain move backwards in the sky, or retrograde. Because it is going around the earth, the Moon is\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain never retrograde5 The apparent motion of the Sun is never retrograde. All of the planets\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain themselves are retrograde part of the time. The lunar and planetary nodes are always\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain clockwise in their motion.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Years back, Evangeline Adams placed great emphasis on retrograde planets. She claimed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that the stock market was always weak when planets, but particularly hercury, were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain retrograde. Ever since that time, astrologers have been writing that the stock market is weak\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when planets are retrograde. This claim is entirely false.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain In 1938, a Wall Street man came to call on the writer. He asked whether the writer believed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that the stock market is weak when Mercury or any other planet is retrograde. The writer\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain stated that he did not, and a test was agreed upon. It cost about $3000 to make this test. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain record of market movement for every period when Mercury (and all the other planets) was\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain retrograde was compared with every period when Mercury was direct. This record included\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the entire available history of the stock market. A figure was established for the average daily\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain motion of the stock market when Mercury was retrograde and compared with the figure for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain the average daily motion of the stock market when Mercury was direct. The two figures came\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain out even. Results bearing on tests with the other planets were the same, All results were\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain negative.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Tests were then continued to test all the astrological systems of forecasting the stock market\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that had been published. None of them stood up, with the exception of the lunar node cycle,\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain but the cycle was too long for a legitimate test (l8 years). This cycle appeared to stand up\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain fairly well but we had less than three complete cycles to test, and during the next fifteen\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain years, this cycle broke down also.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain These tests continued, and we tested nearly all the possibilities we could think of ourselves.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Although we found some statistically significant results, they were not too important. A\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Boston banker spent in the neighborhood of a half million dollars making similar tests. He\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain told us he got good results and that they made far more money for him than his research\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain costs, but he kept the results to himself. We would not advise you to try beating the stock\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain market by astrology unless you have a half million dollars to spend on research.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Grant Lewi believed in retrograde planets, although Grant didn't very often fall for unreliable\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ideas. The two of us discussed this subject a great deal. He maintained that his business\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain always slowed down when Mercury was retrograde. The writer went home and put a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain statistical yard-stick to his own business records. He found that business was just as good\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when Mercury was retrograde as when it was direct. He went back to GL, showed him the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain statistical results and asked permission to submit GL's business records to the same statistical\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain results. Permission was readily granted. The result was the same, Business was just as strong\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain when Mercury was retrograde as when it was direct.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain This demonstrates that the best of us must realize how faulty our own memories and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain observations may be. We cannot trust memory. That is why it is important to keep records.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Don't trust your memory. If you "believe" something, it is easy to see it when it doesn't exist.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain On the other hand, it is human to be blind to anything that does not agree with an accepted\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain hypothesis. This was once brought home to tie writer with a great impact.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain While interviewing one of the top academic scientists of the country, the writer questioned\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one of the scientist's pet hypotheses and drew the very eluctant admission that there was no\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain real proof. However, the admission did not come without annoyance and irritability on the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain part of the academician. We put this question to him.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain "You admit that there is no statistical evidence for the claims you have publicly made.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Suppose some outside party were to make a statistical test and found your claims to be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain wrong. What would you do?"\par
\pard\f0\fs22\b He replied, "I WOULDN'T BE INTERESTED."\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Please don't follow this man's example. Be willing to make statistical tests. Learn HOW to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain make statistical tests. We will discuss this subject later, but get in the habit of submitting\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain ideas and claims to severe tests. Remember that there are hundreds of unreliable books on\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrology on the market, written by people with little or no experience in astrology. They\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain merely picked up their ideas from someone else and passed them along. One difficulty is that\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they do not even pass them along accurately. As with memory, statements are distorted.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We are anxious to have you realize that everything can be resolved down to the question of\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain whether a pattern is to be perpetuated or discarded. In some cases, however, we must\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain consider patterns of motion. The motion may be a constant. Is it going to remain as a\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain constant? Is it going to accelerate or decelerate?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Aside from reckless or drunken drivers of automobiles, the fast driver may be a better and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain safer driver than the slow driver. He may be far-sighted. He sees further ahead and\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain anticipates the future better. The slow driver may be near-sighted. He has never learned to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain gage the speed of other cars. He drives right into the path of an oncoming car that has the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain right of way. Either the car seems a long distance away to him, or he doesn't see it at all.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Watch the slow driver, the fellow who honestly believes that he is a careful driver. He often\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain lacks understanding of speed and distance. He has no true conception of them. He drives\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain right in front of an oncoming object and is oblivious to the danger. On the Los Angeles\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain freeways, you can be arrested for driving too slowly. In the old days they used to tell the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain story of the Philadelphia lawyer who went to New York and was run over by a hearse.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Thus, patterns involve motion, and these too can be destroyed, as when the irresistable force\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain meets the immovable object. Even so, the slow automobile driver needs concern himself only\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain with two dimensions. The plane pilot must deal with three dimensions. His job is more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain complex.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have divided all of the astrological factors, the zodiacal signs, the planets, the planetary\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain aspects and the astrological houses into factors definitely representing either the past or the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain future. All problems resolve themselves down to this one basic factor. Will things remain as\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain they are, or will they change? What pattern is to predominate, the same old pattern or the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain new one? Let us look at some of the common questions that repeatedly fly across an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain astrologer's desk:\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Will I get married? Will my husband ever change? Will I get well? Will I be able to pay my\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain bills? Should I buy a new car? Can I sell my house? TVill my husband give me a divorce? Will I\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain be happy if I marry this man? Should I hire this man? Should I buy this hotel? Would I be more\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain successful if I moved out west? Can I ever have children?\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Everybody is concerned with whether they should hold on to an old pattern or adopt a new\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain one. Hitler wanted one pattern. The Communists wanted another. We had our own choice.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain Different creeds battle for different patterns in their own way. The architect is almost totally\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain concerned with patterns of the future. He designs buildings but he may merely repeat old\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain designs. Engineers design bridges. They all have to know enough about mathematics to build\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain their edifices in accord with abstract laws. They must calculate how much weight the floors\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain and the bridges will hold. Miscalculations may cause a building to fail down, or may cause an\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain automobile driver to lose his car or his body. When the writer was a boy, the speed limit for\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain automobiles in many towns was eight miles per hour. Today, he can drive down one of the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain main thoroughfares of town and the speed limit is 45 miles per hour. In some places speeds\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that were illegal because they were too fast are now illegal because they are too slow.\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain We have dwelled at length on these factors, because it will make all interpretations easier, if\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you never lose sight of the fact that there is always the question as to whether things are to\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain remain as they are or are to change. Some people want the pattern of the past to prevail\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain because they feel insecure when facing any kind of change. Other people always want a new\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain pattern, always want change, because unless things can exist in motion, these people get fed\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain up, irritable and rebellious. Fortunately for these people, the solar system moves. Other\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain people want change but they are afraid of it. They fear going after what they want. They talk\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain about it all the time, but they never do anything about it. They may never leave the town\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain where they were born. Examine the hproscope of such people, and you will find out why. If\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain you can question these people in such a way as to allow them to see why they cling to certain\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain things of the past as security, when they are not security at all, you will kick a spring. You'll\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain see them let go, and when they do, there will suddenly be a new flow of energy. They will be\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain in motion. They will be doing things. They'll know what they want and they will move so fast\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain that you will have a hard job giving them advice. They will no longer feel the need of it Their\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain health will be better too. However, when you want to travel at high speeds, you travel in the\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain field of dynamics, and you have to know more about the mathematics of dynamics. Things\par
\pard\f1\fs20\plain have to be streamlined, and you may need sweptback wings.\par
